io, Rapinoe and Equal Pay', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': "Women's World Cup (Soccer)", 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Soccer Federation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "United States Women's National Soccer Team", 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lloyd, Carli (1982- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rapinoe, Megan', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-01T00:27:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Borden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Borden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Question', '_id': 'nyt://article/f4325e7d-614a-56fc-ba8f-59e6f69f677f', 'word_count': 1097, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f4325e7d-614a-56fc-ba8f-59e6f69f677f'}, {'abstract': 'According to new studies, the answer isn’t yes. But it isn’t no, either.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/02/opinion/sunday/is-there-a-ferguson-effect.html', 'snippet': 'According to new studies, the answer isn’t yes. But it isn’t no, either.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This week, the F.B.I. released its official tally of crime in the United States in 2015. As expected, the numbers show an uptick in violence. In the nation as a whole, violent crime rose 3.9 percent last year. Homicides were up 10.8 percent, aggravated assaults 4.6 percent, robberies 1.4 percent.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/02/opinion/sunday/02gray/02gray-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75