uri': 'nyt://article/2041bd13-5b73-55c7-bf16-cc68d2a2d8b4'}, {'abstract': 'By defeating the Phillies on the road Friday night, the Mets’ magic number for a National League wild-card berth stood at a single game.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/01/sports/baseball/new-york-mets-philadelphia-phillies.html', 'snippet': 'By defeating the Phillies on the road Friday night, the Mets’ magic number for a National League wild-card berth stood at a single game.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PHILADELPHIA — The Mets’ improbable, topsy-turvy season has tiptoed to the edge of a crucial moment. With their 5-1 win over the Philadelphia Phillies on Friday night, the Mets stood one victory away from securing a playoff berth that seemed impossible to attain six weeks ago.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/01/sports/01-CITY-METS/01-CITY-METS-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/01/sports/01-CITY-METS/01-CITY-METS-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/01/sports/01-CITY-METS/01-CITY-METS-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/01/sports/01-CITY-METS/01-CITY-METS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 453, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/01/sports/01-CITY-METS/01-CITY-METS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 453}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/01/sp