e2-f2fe-5aeb-899c-2cf8bdbdbce3'}, {'abstract': 'James said Smith, a shooting guard who is a free agent, had done his part.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/01/sports/lebron-james-urges-the-cavaliers-to-re-sign-jr-smith.html', 'snippet': 'James said Smith, a shooting guard who is a free agent, had done his part.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LeBron James commented Friday on the Cleveland Cavaliers’ contract impasse with his unsigned teammate J .R. Smith, saying Smith “did his part” and the Cavaliers now “just need to get it done.”', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'LeBron James Urges the Cavaliers to Re-Sign J.R. Smith', 'kicker': 'Sports Briefing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'James Urges the Cavaliers to Re-Sign Smith', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cleveland Cavaliers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'James, LeBron', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Smith, J R', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Washington Redskins', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Norman, Josh (1987- )', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cincinnati Reds', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-01T04:11:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1e243e05-ef97-5be9-9841-dcb8c4d1e255', 'word_count': 1087, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1e243e05-ef97-5be9-9841-dcb8c4d1e255'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Brand wrote books and scores for musicals and films, but was best known for WNYC’s “Folksong Festival,” the longest-running radio show in history with a single host.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/02/arts/music/oscar-brand-folk-singer-whose-radio-show-twanged-for-decades-dies-at-96.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Brand wrote books and scores for musicals and films, but was best known for WNYC’s “Folksong Festival,” the longest-running radio show in history with a single host.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Oscar Brand, the lanky, affable, gravelly-voiced folk singer and songwriter whose weekly on-air hootenanny was the longest-running radio show in history with a single host, died on Friday at his home in Great Neck, N.Y. He was 96.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/01/us/02BRAND1-obit/02BRAND1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/01/us/02BRAND1-obit/02BRAND1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/01/us/02BRAND1-obit/02BRAND1-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/01/us/02BRAND1-obit/02BRAND1-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/01/us/02BRAND1-obit/02BRAND1-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/01/us/02BRAND1-obit/02BRAND1-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy'