2, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e5889dbd-4b76-5e7c-8541-e1fde6e95571'}, {'abstract': 'The Bridgegate scandal that has tarnished Governor Christie seems to underscore a point he once made: New Jersey politics will always have corruption.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/02/opinion/sunday/corruption-in-the-soprano-state.html', 'snippet': 'The Bridgegate scandal that has tarnished Governor Christie seems to underscore a point he once made: New Jersey politics will always have corruption.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Six years ago New Jersey’s new governor, Chris Christie, walked into a movie theater with a political ally named Bill Baroni and several actors from “The Sopranos.” The film they were there to see was “The Soprano State,” a documentary on political corruption in New Jersey, filled with tales of no-show jobs, cash-stuffed envelopes passed across linoleum diner tables and government contracts won with pay-to-play campaign donations.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/02/opinion/sunday/02katz/02katz-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/02/opinion/sunday/02katz/02katz-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/02/opinion/sunday/02katz/02katz-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/02/opinion/sunday/02katz/02katz-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 482, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/02/opinion/sunday/02katz/02katz-articleLarge.jpg