paolo Piccioli shows his first solo collection for Valentino.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/03/fashion/paris-fashion-week-valentino-pierpaolo-piccioli.html', 'snippet': 'Pierpaolo Piccioli shows his first solo collection for Valentino.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — When it was announced, back in July, that the design team of Maria Grazia Chiuri and Pierpaolo Piccioli, whose vision of Valentino-after-Valentino had propelled the brand to billion-dollar status, was breaking up, and that Mr. Piccioli was going to be in sole charge of the house, there were a number of raised eyebrows. Industry watchers immediately began to play the guessing game of “who did what,” and wonder how things may change as a result.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'At Valentino, Pierpaolo Piccioli’s Metamorphosis', 'kicker': 'Fashion Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Flying Solo at Valentino', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Paris Fashion Week', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Valentino Fashion Group SpA', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Piccioli, Pierpaolo', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-02T17:04:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vanessa Friedman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vanessa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Friedman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/8efea5eb-c60c-54e5-a28c-1febacca0109', 'word_count': 471, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8efea5eb-c60c-54e5-a28c-1febacca0109'}, {'abstract': 'Colts quarterback Andrew Luck led a spirited comeback, but the Jaguars improved