of a competition for the best audience roar — but this season, even that seemed strained.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The wow moment in most Fall for Dance Festival programs comes in a propulsive unison finale or a virtuosic solo. But last Wednesday at City Center, the “wow” was more of a “whoa” as Wendy Whelan, the esteemed ballerina, sauntered across the stage wearing only a white button-down shirt with black nylons, garters and high heels. She stopped, stared and stubbed out a cigarette on her tongue.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/04/arts/04FALLNOTEBOOK1/04FALLNOTEBOOK1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/04/arts/04FALLNOTEBOOK1/04FALLNOTEBOOK1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/04/arts/04FALLNOTEBOOK1/04FALLNOTEBOOK1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/04/arts/04FALLNOTEBOOK1/04FALLNOTEBOOK1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 604, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/04/arts/04FALLNOTEBOOK1/04FALLNOTEBOOK1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 604}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/04/arts/04FALLNOTEBOOK1/04FALLNOTEBOOK1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1018, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/04/arts/0