s', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Protesters in Poland Rally Against Proposal for Total Abortion Ban', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Protesters in Poland Rally Against a Proposal to Criminalize All Abortions', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ABORTION', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Warsaw (Poland)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Poland', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-03T20:58:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joanna Berendt', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joanna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Berendt', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cd0cf4df-7d09-5044-86f8-4b92488b6809', 'word_count': 889, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cd0cf4df-7d09-5044-86f8-4b92488b6809'}, {'abstract': 'A new exhibition features intimate etchings made between 2006 and the artist’s death in 2010 at age 98 — along with portraits made of her during the same period.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2016/10/03/t-magazine/art/louise-bourgeois-in-her-90s.html', 'snippet': 'A new exhibition features intimate etchings made between 2006 and the artist’s death in 2010 at age 98 — along with portraits made of her during the same period.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A new exhibition features intimate etchings made between 2006 and the artist’s death in 2010 at age 98 — along with portraits made of her during the same period.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/03/t-magazine/art/03tmag-bourgeois-slide-HO6L/