d yesterday [Oct. 3], gives the Army Council, the Admiralty and the Chancellor of the Exchequer full power to regulate or prohibit the purchase, the production and the sale of all foods and food products, forage and merchandise of every kind as well as to requisition them. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/05/blogs/05oldiht-1916-britain/05oldiht-1916-britain-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/05/blogs/05oldiht-1916-britain/05oldiht-1916-britain-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/05/blogs/05oldiht-1916-britain/05oldiht-1916-britain-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/05/blogs/05oldiht-1916-britain/05oldiht-1916-britain-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 500, 'width': 347, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/05/blogs/05oldiht-1916-britain/05oldiht-1916-britain-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 500, 'width': 347, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1916: Britain to Raise New War Credit', 'kicker': 'IHT Retrospective', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Food', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Legislatures and Parliaments', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-04T1