g number of law enforcement agencies have endorsed the concept, but commitment to it varies widely by department, and even by officer.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/us/06deescalate-4/06deescalate-4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 567, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/06/us/06deescalate-4/06deescalate-4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 567}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/us/06deescalate-4/06deescalate-4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 967, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/us/06deescalate-4/06deescalate-4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1934, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/us/06deescalate-4/06deescalate-4-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/06/us/06deescalate-4/06deescalate-4-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/us/06deescalate-4/06deescalate-4-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Could Officers Have Avoided Shooting Keith Scott? Experts Weigh In', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Standoff in Charlotte: Did the Police Need to Shoot?', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub