8ec57ab'}, {'abstract': 'A nine-day retrospective also includes “The Mahabharata,” a TV treatment of Mr. Brook’s theatrical adaptation of the Sanskrit epic poem.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/09/movies/lord-of-the-flies-and-more-from-peter-brook-at-bamcinematek.html', 'snippet': 'A nine-day retrospective also includes “The Mahabharata,” a TV treatment of Mr. Brook’s theatrical adaptation of the Sanskrit epic poem.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The revered theater director Peter Brook has made only a handful of films, but they include one cinematic classic: “Lord of the Flies,” his 1963 adaptation of William Golding’s apocalyptic fable of British schoolboys on a desert island, and of how quickly a civilized veneer can crack into barbarism. It’s the highlight of BAMcinématek’s nine-day retrospective “Peter Brook: Behind the Camera,” starting Monday, Oct. 10.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/09/arts/109WEEKAHEAD6/109WEEKAHEAD6-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 259, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/09/arts/109WEEKAHEAD6/109WEEKAHEAD6-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 259}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/09/arts/109WEEKAHEAD6/109WEEKAHEAD6-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 442, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/09/arts/109WEEKAHEAD6/109WEEKAHEAD6-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 883, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/09/arts/109WEEKAHEAD6/109WEEKAHEAD6-thumbStandard