 the clothes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/06/fashion/paris-fashion-week-louis-vuitton-miu-miu.html', 'snippet': 'Even as the industry grapples with changes at the top and the “see now, buy now” trend, sometimes — as at Louis Vuitton — it’s just about the clothes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — The Paris shows began in a building site — Yves Saint Laurent’s new headquarters on the Rue de Bellechasse — and they ended in one too: Louis Vuitton’s new maison on the Place Vendôme, due to open next July. At the moment it is five floors of raw concrete with floor-to-ceiling windows looking onto the square. Bernard Arnault, the chief executive of LVMH Moët Hennessy Louis Vuitton, was busy taking photos of the view with his iPhone.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Renovating Fashion’s House', 'kicker': 'Fashion Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Renovating Their Houses', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Paris Fashion Week', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Louis Vuitton', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Miu Miu (Fashion Label)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Moncler (Fashion Label)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-05T14:27:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vanessa Friedman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vanessa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Friedman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/15c0d632-a877-520e-ba5c-fc6b33180ce6', 'word_count': 805, 'uri': 'nyt://article/15c0d632-a877-520e-ba5c-fc6b33180ce6'}, {'abstract': '“You’ve whipped out that Mexican thing again,” Gov. Mike Pence told Senator Tim Kaine, launching a new phrase into the online political conversation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/06/us/politics/that-mexican-thing.html', 'snippet': '“You’ve whipped out that Mexican thing again,” Gov. Mike Pence told Senator Tim Kaine, launching a new phrase into the online political conversation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the grand digital tradition of American political debates, the audience tends to seize upon singular phrases or gestures that, at least for a few hours, seem to define the evening’s discussion.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘That Mexican Thing’ Takes On Life After the Debate', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pence, Mike', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kaine, Timothy M', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mexico', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Hillary Rodham', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Virginia', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Indiana', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-05T14:39:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Katie Rogers', 'person': [{'fir