uestions about the storm.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2016/10/05/us/hurricane-matthew-questions.html', 'snippet': 'John Schwartz, a New York Times reporter who covers climate change and the environment, is answering reader questions about the storm.', 'lead_paragraph': 'John Schwartz, a New York Times reporter who covers climate change and the environment, is answering reader questions about the storm.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ask the Eye: Hurricane Matthew', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2016-10-05T15:33:57+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'U.S.', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/b60d2f4e-3654-57fe-9679-757a0629a829', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/b60d2f4e-3654-57fe-9679-757a0629a829'}, {'abstract': 'The Clinton and Trump teams each praised their vice-presidential candidates after the debate between Mike Pence and Tim Kaine.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/06/us/politics/vice-presidential-debate-mike-pence-tim-kaine.html', 'snippet': 'The Clinton and Trump teams each praised their vice-presidential candidates after the debate between Mike Pence and Tim Kaine.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Donald J. Trump hailed Mike Pence’s steady debate performance as a credit to his own judgment on Wednesday in a renewed attempt to allay voters’ concerns about his temperament and readiness for the presidency.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'After Mike Pence’s Debate Showing, Donald Trump Takes Credit', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lauding Running Mate, Trump Also Takes Credit', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': '