ction includes a wall-mounted console, a sofa and a coffee table that were produced by the gallery’s workshop in France. “We wanted him to express himself without the constraints” of manufacturing cost, said Julien Lombrail, a founder of Carpenters Workshop Gallery. “They’re functional sculptures.”', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/28/style/06CURRENTSKAGAN2/06CURRENTSKAGAN2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/09/28/style/06CURRENTSKAGAN2/06CURRENTSKAGAN2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/28/style/06CURRENTSKAGAN2/06CURRENTSKAGAN2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/28/style/06CURRENTSKAGAN2/06CURRENTSKAGAN2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 849, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/09/28/style/06CURRENTSKAGAN2/06CURRENTSKAGAN2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 849}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/28/style/06CURRENTSKAGAN2/06CURRENTSKAGAN2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 724, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/09/28/style/06CURRENTSKAGAN2/06CURRENTSKAGAN2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1448, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Vladimir Kagan