ration, a Pamela Love sample sale and more.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/06/fashion/shopping-bloomingdales-breast-cancer-research-cos-loeffler-randall.html', 'snippet': 'A COS collection that celebrates Agnes Martin, a Dion Lee collaboration, a Pamela Love sample sale and more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Saturday, kick off Breast Cancer Awareness Month with a Pure Yoga class ($10) at Bloomingdale’s 59th Street at 8:30 a.m., before the store opens. Then at noon, the illustrator Donald Robertson will be signing sweatshirts he designed for the store’s October Pink campaign ($40), with $15 from each sale benefiting the Breast Cancer Research Foundation. … That same day, head to the #GiltLife House, the flash-sale site’s pop-up experience, from 10 a.m. to 6 p.m., to enjoy culinary demonstrations by the James Beard Award-winning chef Chris Fischer and check out fall fashions, like a Marc Jacobs mini suede cross-body ($456), that are available to shop during October. At 4 Centre Market Place. Tickets ($5 for Gilt members) are available at gilt.com. On Sunday, from 11 a.m. to 2 p.m., Kit and Ace, will host a shopping event to celebrate the debut of Love Stories TV, an online platform for wedding videos. The site’s founder, Rachel Jo Silver, will be on hand to help brides-to-be pick honeymoon travel pieces like an easy silk shirtdress ($248). At 255 Elizabeth Street. … Throughout October, Loeffler Randall is inviting customers to shop the showroom at its new SoHo headquarters, where you’ll find pretty fall bits like a flap bucket bag ($350) and silver tassel oxfords ($395). At 588 Broadway, Suite 1203. To book an appointment, visit www.LoefflerRandall.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/fashion/06SCOUTING-COMBO/06SCOUTING-COMBO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbna