, '_id': 'nyt://article/3a92cae2-5a60-5939-9745-32d950d10d0b', 'word_count': 813, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3a92cae2-5a60-5939-9745-32d950d10d0b'}, {'abstract': 'Three Clinton ads depict how young women, children and veterans might respond when shown insults by Mr. Trump, a marked departure from traditional attack ads.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/06/us/politics/campaign-ads.html', 'snippet': 'Three Clinton ads depict how young women, children and veterans might respond when shown insults by Mr. Trump, a marked departure from traditional attack ads.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The ads are stark: Adolescent girls assessing themselves before a mirror or a cellphone camera, stroking their hair, straightening their clothes and seeking personal reassurance about their appearance. The strained self-assessment is then met with a jarring interruption.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/04/us/elections/06clintonads-1475639229804/06clintonads-1475639229804-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/04/us/elections/06clintonads-1475639229804/06clintonads-1475639229804-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/04/us/elections/06clintonads-1475639229804/06clintonads-1475639229804-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/04/us/elections/06clintonads-1475639229804/06clintonads-1475639229804-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'i