ef4f', 'word_count': 946, 'uri': 'nyt://article/391565e9-93ac-5a46-8ea6-fa851073ef4f'}, {'abstract': 'British fashion gets its moment in the spotlight during a royal tour of Canada by the Duchess of Cambridge.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/06/fashion/kate-middleton-canada-duchess-style.html', 'snippet': 'British fashion gets its moment in the spotlight during a royal tour of Canada by the Duchess of Cambridge.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The masses have long been intrigued by royals’ fashion choices, and the royals, in turn, have used their sartorial presentation to establish and manage their reputations in the public eye. In a letter to one of her sons, Queen Victoria, whom a historian once called “the first media monarch,” wrote that what you wear gives “the one outward sign from which people in general can and often do judge upon the inward state of mind and feeling of a person; for this they all see, while the other they cannot.”', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/fashion/06KATE-GRID1/06KATE-GRID1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/06/fashion/06KATE-GRID1/06KATE-GRID1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/fashion/06KATE-GRID1/06KATE-GRID1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/fashion/06KATE-GRID1/06KATE-GRID1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'typ