 who experiences his wife’s pregancy more acutely than most.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In this episode of Modern Love: The Podcast, the actor Dash Mihok (“Ray Donovan,” “I Am Legend”) reads the essay “A Path to Fatherhood, With (Shared) Morning Sickness,” about a man whose wife conceives just before he begins chemotherapy for metastatic cancer.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/06/19/fashion/19MODERNLOVE/19MODERNLOVE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 379, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/06/19/fashion/19MODERNLOVE/19MODERNLOVE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 379}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/06/19/fashion/19MODERNLOVE/19MODERNLOVE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 647, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/06/19/fashion/19MODERNLOVE/19MODERNLOVE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1293, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/06/19/fashion/19MODERNLOVE/19MODERNLOVE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/06/19/fashion/19MODERNLOVE/19MODERNLOVE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/06/19/fashion/19MODERNLOVE/19MODERNLOVE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Modern Love Podcast: Dash Mihok Reads ‘A Path to Fa