. The Mets injected hope into New York with a spirited sprint to the playoffs, posting the best record in baseball during a six-week stretch and overcoming injuries that could have crippled their season. The Mets then escaped trouble so many times in Wednesday’s win-or-go-home National League wild-card game against the San Francisco Giants that they appeared capable of conquering the October legend Madison Bumgarner.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/sports/06METS/06METS-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/06/sports/06METS/06METS-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/sports/06METS/06METS-thumbLarge-v4.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/sports/06METS/06METS-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/06/sports/06METS/06METS-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/sports/06METS/06METS-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/sports/06METS/06METS-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Madison Bumgarner and One Big Blast Leave the Mets Blanked and Blue', 'kicker': 'Giants 3, Mets 0', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bumgarner and Big Blast  Leave Mets Blanked and Blue', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wagner, James', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'San Francisco Giants', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Syndergaard, Noah', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bumgarner, Madison', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gillaspie, Conor (1987- )', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Playoff Games', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-06T03:22:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By James Wagner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wagner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c6a21116-36db-5461-95af-adb63a3e1df4', 'word_count': 1244, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c6a21116-36db-5461-95af-adb63a3e1df4'}, {'abstract': 'Researchers build a data base of hundreds of small urban and rural projects that, together, could form the foundation of a prosperous and sustainable civilization.', 'web_url': 'https://dotearth.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/10/06/building-a-good-anthropocene-from-the-bottom-up/', 'snippet': 'Researchers build a data base of hundreds of small urban and rural projects that, together, could form the foundation of a prosperous and sustainable civilization.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Over the last few years, I’ve gotten to know a determined cast of characters in academia aiming to identify