. Scott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'A.', 'middlename': 'O.', 'lastname': 'Scott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/bb7f85b1-8022-59c9-a80a-0388f95ebb07', 'word_count': 1548, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bb7f85b1-8022-59c9-a80a-0388f95ebb07'}, {'abstract': 'Among the players set up to perform well in Week 5 is Tom Brady, who could be rusty after his four-game suspension but has the good fortune to play Cleveland.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/06/sports/football/fantasy-football-players-to-start-in-week-5.html', 'snippet': 'Among the players set up to perform well in Week 5 is Tom Brady, who could be rusty after his four-game suspension but has the good fortune to play Cleveland.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Sablich brothers have provided award-winning fantasy football advice for The New York Times since 2010. See their weekly player rankings, and visit 5thDownFantasy.com for more fantasy analysis. You can also ask them questions through their Twitter account, @5thdownfantasy.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/sports/06fantasy-web/06fantasy-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/06/sports/06fantasy-web/06fantasy-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/sports/06fantasy-web/06fantasy-web-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/sports/06fantasy-web/06fantasy-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 