 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/999d6179-0731-585c-8dd0-dc892a5a00bc', 'word_count': 601, 'uri': 'nyt://article/999d6179-0731-585c-8dd0-dc892a5a00bc'}, {'abstract': 'Eye-catching, exaggerated rounded sleeves have appeared on runways at Jacquemus, Stella McCartney and Salvatore Ferragamo.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/06/t-magazine/fashion/white-dresses-trend-jacquemus-stella-mccartney-ferragamo-fashion-week.html', 'snippet': 'Eye-catching, exaggerated rounded sleeves have appeared on runways at Jacquemus, Stella McCartney and Salvatore Ferragamo.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Continuing what’s emerged as a theme in Milan and Paris — unexpected plays on volume — several designers have put a spin on the classic white dress by adding exaggerated rounded sleeves. Back in Milan, Salvatore Ferragamo showed a stark white design with sleeves that were ruched to add dimension. The young designer Jacquemus, whose obscure silhouettes put him on the map, sent out a short white shirtdress with eye-catching round sleeves on the first day of Paris Fashion Week. And a few days ago, Stella McCartney’s version of the roomy sleeve trend came with a poplin below-the-knee dress.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/t-magazine/fashion/06tmag-trendsleeves/06tmag-trendsleeves-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/06/t-magazine/fashion/06tmag-trendsleeves/06tmag-trendsleeves-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/t-magazine/fashion/06tmag-trendsleeves/06tmag-trendsleeves-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/t-magazine/fashion/06tmag-trendsleeves/06tmag-trendsleeves-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/06/t-magazine/fashion/06tmag-trendsleeves/06tmag-trendsleeves-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/t-magazine/fashion/06tmag-trendsleeves/06tmag-trendsleeves-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/t-magazine/fashion/06tmag-trendsleeves/06tmag-trendsleeves-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Three’s a Trend: White Dresses, With Roomy Sleeves', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Paris Fashion Week', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ferragamo, Salvatore, Italia SpA', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Jacquemus (Fashion Label)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCartney, Stella', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-06T16:22:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'subsection_name': 'Fashion & Beauty', 'byline': {'original': 'By Angela Koh', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Angela', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Koh', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/708cf216-8fcf-55a4-9786-e2199e6a913e', 'word_count': 99, 'uri': 'nyt://article/708cf216-8fcf-55a4-9786-e2199e6a913e'}, {'abstract': 'Hurricane Matthew will test Floridians’ level of “disaster amnesia” given the 11 years that have passed since the state was struck by a major hurricane.', 'web_url': 'https://dotearth.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/10/06/after-11-years-in-a-hurricane-drought-floridians-flee-major-matthew-threat/', 'snippet': 'Hurricane Matthew will test Floridians’ level of “disaster amnesia” given the 11 years that have passed since the state was struck by a major hurricane.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A lot has changed in Florida since Oct. 22, 2005, when Hurricane Wilma roared west to east across the peninsula at Category 3 strength, making it the last major hurricane (storms in that category and stronger) to come ashore in the United States. On coasts there and elsewhere in hurricane danger zones, populations and development have grown and spread tremendously in a long storm lull.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/blogs/dotmatthewcoast/dotmatthewcoast-thumbStandard-v4.gif', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/06/blogs/dotmatthewcoast/dotmatthewcoast-thumbStandard-v4.gif', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/blogs/dotmatthewcoast/dotmatthewcoast-thumbLarge-v4.gif', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/blogs/dotmatthewcoast/dotmatthewcoast-articleLarge-v4.gif', 'height': 480, 'w