d even a shocking departure — the spring/summer 2017 shows were all about the new.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/06/t-magazine/fashion/theyskens-dior-saint-laurent-new-designers-paris-fashion-week.html', 'snippet': 'From designer debuts, much-anticipated returns — and even a shocking departure — the spring/summer 2017 shows were all about the new.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The focus of the spring/summer 2017 Paris Fashion Week was undoubtedly, relentlessly, on the new. New labels, new designers at houses, lots of new clothes, a few new ideas. You may wind up asking: “What’s new?” The last five years have been characterized by that situation. Newness is nothing new.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/t-magazine/fashion/06-furynew/06-furynew-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/06/t-magazine/fashion/06-furynew/06-furynew-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/t-magazine/fashion/06-furynew/06-furynew-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/t-magazine/fashion/06-furynew/06-furynew-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/t-magazine/fashion/06-furynew/06-furynew-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/06/t-magazine/fashion/06-furynew/06-furynew-thumbStandard.jpg', 