ery of Everything, comes with an assist from Jarvis Cocker.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2016/10/06/t-magazine/art/the-gallery-of-everything.html', 'snippet': 'The inaugural exhibition at the outsider-art aficionado James Brett’s newest venture, the Gallery of Everything, comes with an assist from Jarvis Cocker.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The inaugural exhibition at the outsider-art aficionado James Brett’s newest venture, the Gallery of Everything, comes with an assist from Jarvis Cocker.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/t-magazine/art/james-brett-slide-I87Q/james-brett-slide-I87Q-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/06/t-magazine/art/james-brett-slide-I87Q/james-brett-slide-I87Q-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/t-magazine/art/james-brett-slide-I87Q/james-brett-slide-I87Q-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/t-magazine/art/james-brett-slide-I87Q/james-brett-slide-I87Q-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 393, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/06/t-magazine/art/james-brett-slide-I87Q/james-brett-slide-I87Q-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 393}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/t-magazine/art/james-brett-slide-I87Q/james-brett-slide-I87Q-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 670, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/t-magazine/art/james-brett-slide-I87Q/james-brett-slide-I87Q-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1341, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Gallery of Everything', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2016-10-06T20:22:13+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'T Magazine', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'subsection_name': 'Art', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/445a5f00-d3e9-5c8a-92a7-0a4d01e18035', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/445a5f00-d3e9-5c8a-92a7-0a4d01e18035'}, {'abstract': 'Jarvis Cocker, of Pulp, and James Brett have collaborated on a show of alternative artists in London at Brett’s new space, the Gallery of Everything.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/06/t-magazine/art/jarvis-cocker-james-brett-gallery-of-everything.html', 'snippet': 'Jarvis Cocker, of Pulp, and James Brett have collaborated on a show of alternative artists in London at Brett’s new space, the Gallery of Everything.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The friendship between the musician Jarvis Cocker and the curator James Brett first flowered some six years ago in a onetime recording studio in Primrose Hill, London. It was here that Brett, a certified Pulp fan, first displayed the dizzying assortment of self-taught art that drew more than 35,000 visitors to the Museum of Everything, following its opening in 2009. Among the wondrous works on display was a screening of the little-known ’90s television documentary “Journeys Into the Outside,” in which Cocker had tracked down some of the marginalized creators of so-called outsider art. Ever curious, Cocker came along to the museum: “I’d heard that they were putting together an exhibition at the studio where I used to record,” he recalls by phone from France. “I liked the way Brett mixed everything together. He seemed to have found a good way to show that type of art that kept the spirit alive. It doesn’t work if it’s too reverential. The museum had an entertaining aspect to it, not too serious or formal. It was an occasion to go there.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/t-magazine/art/james-brett-slide-20M4/james-brett-slide-20M4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/06/t-magazine/art/james-brett-slide-20M4/james-brett-slide-20M4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/t-magazine/art/james-brett-slide-20M4/james-brett-slide-20M4-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/t-magazine/art/james-brett-slide-20M4/james-brett-slide-20M4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 403, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/06/t-magazine/art/james-brett-slide-20M4/james-brett-slide-20M4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 403}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/t-magazine/art/james-brett-slide-20M4/james-brett-slide-20M4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 688, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/06/t-magazine/art/james-brett-slide-20M4/james-bre