tist, in partnership with his children, who will put their paintings on loan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/08/arts/design/mark-rothko-portland-museum-of-art-rothko-pavilion-new-wing.html', 'snippet': 'The Portland Art Museum has announced an expansion in honor of the artist, in partnership with his children, who will put their paintings on loan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Under the heading of local-boy-makes-good, the painter Mark Rothko and Portland, Ore., have never really been paired in the public imagination. Rothko, whose family emigrated to Portland when he was 10 from what is now Latvia, left for Yale and then New York and returned only infrequently to his hometown during his lifetime.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/08/arts/07rothko2/07rothko2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/08/arts/07rothko2/07rothko2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/08/arts/07rothko2/07rothko2-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/08/arts/07rothko2/07rothko2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 778, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/08/arts/07rothko2/07rothko2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 778}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/08/arts/07rothko2/07rothko2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 791, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name