nment of Salvador Allende.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '33', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/09/books/review/1009-BKS-Dorfman/1009-BKS-Dorfman-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 493, 'width': 538, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/09/books/review/1009-BKS-Dorfman/1009-BKS-Dorfman-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 493, 'width': 538, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/09/books/review/1009-BKS-Dorfman/1009-BKS-Dorfman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/09/books/review/1009-BKS-Dorfman/1009-BKS-Dorfman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/09/books/review/1009-BKS-Dorfman/1009-BKS-Dorfman-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Exile With ‘Don Quixote’', 'kicker': 'Critic’s Take', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Exile With ‘Don Quixote’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dorfman, Ariel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cervantes, Miguel de', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Writing and Writers', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Don Quixote (Book)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-07T16:43:56+0000', 'document_type': 'articl