e exits.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/08/arts/08QUADRILLE2/08QUADRILLE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 528, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/08/arts/08QUADRILLE2/08QUADRILLE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 528}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/08/arts/08QUADRILLE2/08QUADRILLE2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 901, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/08/arts/08QUADRILLE2/08QUADRILLE2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1802, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/08/arts/08QUADRILLE2/08QUADRILLE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/08/arts/08QUADRILLE2/08QUADRILLE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/08/arts/08QUADRILLE2/08QUADRILLE2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: This Dance Is a Jolt at the Joyce Theater', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Waiting to See  How Far  They Go', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Joyce Theater', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Landon, Loni', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': "O'Connor, Tere", 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Spradlin, RoseAnne', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'X (Dance)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Fast Love (Dance)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Undersweet (Dance)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Festivals', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-07T21:57:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Seibert', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Seibert', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/aaea0390-83fc-5816-b77b-e958d75f9978', 'word_count': 564, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aaea0390-83fc-5816-b77b-e958d75f9978'}, {'abstract': 'How a state with some of the mildest politics in the South became a magnet for national partisanship.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/07/magazine/what-happened-to-north-carolina.html', 'snippet': 'How a state with some of the mildest politics in the South became a magnet for national partisanship.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In late September, the skies opened over North Carolina. The remnants of Tropical Storm Julia crashed into Bertie County, on the Albemarle Sound inside the barrier islands of the Outer Banks, sending cascades of muddy water into homes and stores and forcing officials to release a herd of bison kept at a local zoo. Gov. Pat McCrory diverted his increasingly struggling re-election campaign to tour the soggy town. He had barely had time to do so before another storm, 130 miles inland, sent several feet of water from the Cape Fear basin racing through Fayetteville.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/07/magazine/07mag-northcarolina-1/07mag-northcarolina-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/07/magazine/07mag-northcarolina-1/07mag-northcarolina-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/07/magazine/07mag-northcarolina-1/07mag-northcarolina-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/07/magazine/07mag-northcarolina-1/07mag-northcarolina-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/07/magazine/07mag-northcarolina-1/07mag-northcarolina-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/07/magazine/07mag-northcarolina-1/07mag-northcarolina-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/07/magazine/07mag-northcarolina-1/07mag-northcarolina-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What Happened to North Carolina?', 'kicker': 'Notebook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'State Legislatures', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Right