ww.nytimes.com/2016/10/08/magazine/donald-trump-tape.html', 'snippet': 'A taped conversation involving the Republican nominee shows a world women rarely see, and may not forget before Election Day.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Lewd” was apparently not a strong enough word for the editors of The Washington Post when they tried to describe the contents of a recording they had acquired, in which Donald J. Trump is heard in a 2005 conversation with Billy Bush, the Access Hollywood host; they went with “extremely lewd” in their headline.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Donald Trump: King of the Old Boys’ Club, and Perhaps Its Destroyer', 'kicker': 'Notebook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bush, Billy (1971- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zucker, Arianne (1974- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sexual Harassment', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Washington Post', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings, Downloads and Streaming', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-08T03:01:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Susan Dominus', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Susan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dominus', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2c50fbee-f01f-586b-b65d-2051d183ef36', 'word_count': 665, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2c50fbee-f01f-586b-b65d-2051d183ef36'}, {'abstract': 'All those along Hurricane Matthew’s path need aid. But the Haitians need it most.', 'w