w.nytimes.com/2016/10/09/fashion/weddings/camille-balsan-nicholas-rutherfurd.html', 'snippet': 'The bride is a property manager, and the groom works for an investment firm.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Camille Mathilde Renée Balsan, a daughter of Donna M. Balsan of Paris and the late Humbert J. Balsan, was married Oct. 8 to Nicholas Morton Rutherfurd, a son of the late Jody J. Rutherfurd, who lived in New York, and the late Morton A. Rutherfurd, who lived in Woodbridge, Conn. The Rev. Anita Gordon, a Unitarian Universalist minister, led a nondenominational ceremony at the home of Diane and Hank Louis, an aunt and uncle of the bride, in Park City, Utah.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Camille Balsan, Nicholas Rutherfurd', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Camille Balsan,  Nicholas Rutherfurd', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-09T04:00:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Society', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Weddings', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4b264d0a-68fb-5aff-9816-3edb8497ee83', 'word_count': 244, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4b264d0a-68fb-5aff-9816-3edb8497ee83'}, {'abstract': 'The couple, who met on Tinder in 2015, were married in San Francisco.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/09/fashion/weddings/chloe-andrus-martin-bringmann.html', 'snippet': 'The couple, who met on Tinder in 2015, were married in San Francisco.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Chloé Marie Andrus, a daughter of Sheila Moore Andrus and Bishop Marc H. Andrus of San Francisco, was married Oct. 8 to Martin Bringmann, a son of Martina P. Bringmann and Jörg M. O. Bringmann of Elstal, Germany. The Rev. Robert Brooks, an Episcopal priest and a friend of t