randa hosted the most recent “Saturday Night Live,” looking as giddy and grateful as he did on opening night of his musical “Hamilton.” Even with the mega-popularity of that show, Mr. Miranda, clean shaven and shorn of a ponytail since his days starring in “Hamilton,” acknowledged the rarity of having a musical-theater composer as host of “S.N.L.,” saying at the top of his monologue: “Most of you watching at home have no idea who I am.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Lin-Manuel Miranda Brings ‘Hamilton’ Flavor to ‘S.N.L.’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Miranda, Lin-Manuel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Saturday Night Live (TV Program)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Hamilton (Play)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-09T19:07:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Erik Piepenburg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Erik', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Piepenburg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/012f77e0-ea49-55b0-acf4-ceb8f77a6663', 'word_count': 176, 'uri': 'nyt://article/012f77e0-ea49-55b0-acf4-ceb8f77a6663'}, {'abstract': 'The move is a radical departure for a country that has historically been the most dependable American ally in Southeast Asia, and could undermine President Obama’s foreign policy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/10/world/asia/philippines-rodrigo-duterte-obama.html', 'snippet': 'The move is a radical departure for 