 speed, and ran into the rear of the train. The shock was tremendous. Two third-class carriages were literally smashed to pieces, and a first-class carriage was wrecked. The force of the collision was such that the passenger train was driven up the line a distance of more than one hundred yards. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/10/blogs/10oldiht-1891-trainfrance/10oldiht-1891-trainfrance-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/10/blogs/10oldiht-1891-trainfrance/10oldiht-1891-trainfrance-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/10/blogs/10oldiht-1891-trainfrance/10oldiht-1891-trainfrance-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/10/blogs/10oldiht-1891-trainfrance/10oldiht-1891-trainfrance-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 387, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/10/blogs/10oldiht-1891-trainfrance/10oldiht-1891-trainfrance-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 387}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/10/blogs/10oldiht-1891-trainfrance/10oldiht-1891-trainfrance-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 516, 'width': 800, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/10/blogs/10oldiht-1891-trainfrance/10oldiht-1891-trainfrance-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 516, 'width': 800, 'subType': 'superJumbo',