y-44-years-and-3-major-terrorism-trials-a-judge-leaves-the-bench.html', 'snippet': 'Judge Kevin Thomas Duffy, who retired last month, is best known for presiding in three of the country’s biggest federal terrorism trials, two of them stemming from the 1993 World Trade Center attack.', 'lead_paragraph': 'From his seat on the bench, Judge Kevin Thomas Duffy listened patiently to the man he would soon put in prison for the rest of his life.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/11/nyregion/00DUFFY1/00DUFFY1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/11/nyregion/00DUFFY1/00DUFFY1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/11/nyregion/00DUFFY1/00DUFFY1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/11/nyregion/00DUFFY1/00DUFFY1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/11/nyregion/00DUFFY1/00DUFFY1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/11/nyregion/00DUFFY1/00DUFFY1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/11/nyregion/00DUFFY1/00DUFFY1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'After Nearly 44 Years, and 3 Major Terrorism Trials, a Judge Leaves the Bench', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Judge Reflects on Terror Trials and a Career’s End  ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Duffy, Kevin Thomas', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yousef, Ramzi Ahmed', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Courts and the Judiciary', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-10T17:50:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Weiser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weiser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9af5c0a0-51c9-5336-80eb-5450407eb028', 'word_count': 997, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9af5c0a0-51c9-5336-80eb-5450407eb028'}, {'abstract': 'This new cookbook from a small Brooklyn cafe is chockablock chocolate.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/12/dining/the-chocolate-room-book.html', 'snippet': 'This new cookbook from a small Brooklyn cafe is chockablock chocolate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Grab that offset spatula, some parchment paper, many slabs of chocolate (60 to 100 percent cacao) and extra-large eggs, and you’re ready to tackle this new collection of recipes from the Chocolate Room, a cafe in Park Slope, Brooklyn, with a branch in Cobble Hill. Consider making a three-layer blackout-style cake (with the thoughtful option of a single layer), a classic chocolate cream pie, a flourless cake baked in a water bath, insanely rich chocolate ice cream or simple dark chocolate and walnut cookies. For each, the equipment needed is thoroughly detailed, as is the shelf life for the results, which can be surprising, like three to four days in the refrigerator for the chocolate cream pie: “There’s Always Room for Chocolate: Recipes From Brooklyn’s the Chocolate Room,” by Naomi Josepher, Jon Payson and Georgia Freedman (Rizzoli $32.50).', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/12/dining/12BURNER-CHOCOALTE-WEB1/12BURNER-CHOCOALTE-WEB1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 878, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/12/dining/12BURNER-CHOCOALTE-WEB1/12BURNER-CHOCOALTE-WEB1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 878}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/12/dining/12BURNER-CHOCOALTE-WEB1/12BURNER-CHOCOALTE-WEB1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 700, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/12/dining/12BURNER-CHOCOALTE-WEB1/12BURNER-CHOCOALTE-WEB1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1425, 'width': 974, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/12/dining/12BURNER-CHOCOALTE-WEB1/12BURNER-CHOCOALTE-WEB1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/12/dining/12BURNER-CHOCOALTE-WEB1/12BURNER-CHOCOALTE-WEB1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/12/dining/12BURNER-CHOCOALTE-WEB1/12BURNER-CHOCOALTE-WEB1-thumbLarge.jpg',