thing possible to deny him the nomination, sustain and support his challengers all the way to the convention, knowing that Trump would try to bring the pillars of the party down upon their heads.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/12/opinion/12douthatWeb/12douthatWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 405, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/12/opinion/12douthatWeb/12douthatWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 405}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/12/opinion/12douthatWeb/12douthatWeb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 691, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/12/opinion/12douthatWeb/12douthatWeb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1383, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/12/opinion/12douthatWeb/12douthatWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/12/opinion/12douthatWeb/12douthatWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/12/opinion/12douthatWeb/12douthatWeb-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Republican Inferno', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Columnist', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican National Committee', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Priebus, Reince R', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ryan, Paul D Jr', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cruz, Ted', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kasich, John R', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-12T07:21:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Campaign Stops', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ross Douthat', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ross', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Douthat', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/b573c418-daf3-572f-8906-53bc3881e5cb', 'word_count': 878, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b573c418-daf3-572f-8906-53bc3881e5cb'}, {'abstract': 'My disease carries an extra burden — the perception that I’ve brought it on myself.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/12/opinion/diabetes-diet-and-shame.html', 'snippet': 'My disease carries an extra burden — the perception that I’ve brought it on myself.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My fingertips are bruised and polka-dotted black because I am, yet again, getting back on track. A three-month bender of unbridled carbohydrate ingestion has left me a skinsack. I am made of headaches, nausea, vomiting and fatigue. After 10, 12 hours of sleep, I still need a nap because I awake hourly in the night, alternating between trips to the kitchen to guzzle diet soda, iced tea or water and trips to the restroom to urinate it all out.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None,