on. Mr. Bigonzetti’s departure, announced on Saturday by La Scala, was attributed to a severe back problem that he has had since early summer. The managing director of La Scala, Alexander Pereira, has appointed Fréderic Olivieri, a former director of the ballet company who is currently the head of La Scala’s dance school, as an interim director until February next year. Mr. Bigonzetti’s version of “Coppelia,” set to have its premiere at La Scala on Dec. 20, has been canceled. Another choreographer for the production will be announced next week, the theater said.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/13/arts/13lascala-item/13lascala-item-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/13/arts/13lascala-item/13lascala-item-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/13/arts/13lascala-item/13lascala-item-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/13/arts/13lascala-item/13lascala-item-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/13/arts/13lascala-item/13lascala-item-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/13/arts/13lascala-item/13lascala-item-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': 