bstract': 'Cookie has a fancy night out and Lucious continues to be the absolute worst.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/13/arts/television/empire-season-3-episode-4-recap.html', 'snippet': 'Cookie has a fancy night out and Lucious continues to be the absolute worst.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After spending an entire afternoon (or at least an entire dress-up montage) choosing an outfit for her date with the handsome city councilman Angelo Dubois, she settles on a tight, short, stunning red dress, then winds up with a face even redder when she shows up at their rendezvous point and discovers it’s a black-tie fund-raising gala, complete with a live performance by an operatic soprano as the evening’s entertainment — all of which her date neglected to mention. In her mile-high heels and similarly elevated hemline, she sticks out like a sore thumb.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/13/arts/television/13empire-2/13empire-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/13/arts/television/13empire-2/13empire-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/13/arts/television/13empire-2/13empire-2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/13/arts/television/13empire-2/13empire-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 415, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/13/arts/television/13empire-2/13empire-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 415}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'captio