ive_works', 'value': "Hillary's America: The Secret History of the Democratic Party (Book)", 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': "D'Souza, Dinesh", 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Armageddon: How Trump Can Beat Hillary (Book)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Morris, Dick', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McGann, Eileen', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Guilty as Sin: Uncovering New Evidence of Corruption and How Hillary Clinton and the Democrats Derailed the FBI Investigation (Book)', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Unlikeable: The Problem With Hillary (Book)', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Klein, Edward', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schmidt, Grant M', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-13T20:59:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Books', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Senior', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Senior', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/f46f3209-acd5-53f8-8971-6a854e911488', 'word_count': 1633, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f46f3209-acd5-53f8-8971-6a854e911488'}, {'abstract': 'Rory Culkin plays a magazine editor who returns to his hometown after his father is killed in a car crash, and delves into a past that’s deeply troubled.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/14/movies/jack-goes-home-review.html', 'snippet': 'Rory Culkin plays a magazine editor who returns to his hometown after his father is killed in a car crash, and delves into a past that’s deeply troubled.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Thomas Dekker’s chiller “Jack Goes Home” gets off to a fine start. Rory Culkin plays Jack Duncan, a magazine editor looking forward to the birth of his child with his pregnant fiancée (Britt Robertson). But when he learns that a car crash has claimed the life of his father, and that his mother has survived, the neutral, unemotional tones with which he announces the news suggest that something in his past is deeply amiss.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/14/arts/14JACKGOESHOME/14JACKGOESHOME-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/14/arts/14JACKGOESHOME/14JACKGOESHOME-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/14/arts/14JACKGOESHOME/14JACKGOESHOME-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/14/arts/14JACKGOESHOME/14JACKGOESHOME-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 253, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/14/arts/14JACKGOESHOME/14JACKGOESHOME-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 253}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/14/arts/14JACKGOESHOME/14JACKGOESHOME-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 432, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/14/arts/14JACKGOESHOME/14JACKGOESHOME-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 864, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: For ‘Jack Goes Home,’ Cue the Horror Soundtrack', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dekker, Thomas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Culkin, Rory', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Jack Goes Home (Movie)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-13T21:02:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andy Webster', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Webster', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/dc895a83-20cd-5426-81ce-2e595a0182b6', 'word_count': 273, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dc895a83-20cd-5426-81ce-2e595a0182b6'}, {'abstract': 'This film, one-sided in its approach, offers painful footage of the bludgeoning of pups in charting the decades-old movement against seal hunting.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/14/movies/huntwatch-review.html', 'snippet': 'This film, one-sided in its approach, offers painful footage of the bludgeoning of pups in charting the decades-old movement against seal hunting.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Experienced seal hunters can club and skin a pup in just 30 seconds, according to the documentary “Huntwatch,” and Brian Davies has spent close to a half-century trying to slow them down. Born in Wales but destined for the vast snowscapes of the Canadian Atlantic coastline, Mr. Davies, founder of the International Fund for Animal Welfare (“Awful name,” he says, grimacing), seems loath to believe that his fight might be unwinnable.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/14/arts/14HUNTWATCH/14HUNTWATCH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/14/arts/14HUNTWATCH/14HUNTWATCH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/14/arts/14HUNTWATCH/14HUNTWATCH-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/14/arts/14HUNTWATCH/14HUNTWATCH-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/14/arts/14HUNTWATCH/14HUNTWATCH-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 800}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/14/arts/14HUNTWATCH/14HUNTWATCH-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/14/arts/14HUNTWATCH/14HUNTWATCH-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1536, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: ‘Huntwatch’ Chronicles a Hard-Fought Battle to Protect Seals', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Huntwatch (Movie)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Seals (Animals) and Sealing', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'International Fund for Animal Welfare', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Animal Abuse, Rights