News', '_id': 'nyt://article/38c7d40a-03a8-51ba-bf52-57bc3b19cf82', 'word_count': 2668, 'uri': 'nyt://article/38c7d40a-03a8-51ba-bf52-57bc3b19cf82'}, {'abstract': 'A look at the many faces of James Whiteside, a principal dancer with American Ballet Theater.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/16/arts/dance/hes-a-ballet-dancer-and-a-singer-and-a-drag-queen.html', 'snippet': 'A look at the many faces of James Whiteside, a principal dancer with American Ballet Theater.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last Halloween, the American Ballet Theater principals James Whiteside and Daniil Simkin took a class dressed as stars from the troupe’s past, to the delight of observers. Mr. Simkin was Mikhail Baryshnikov. But Mr. Whiteside turned heads as the ballerina Gelsey Kirkland, with leotard and skirt, pointe shoes and fake hair in a bun. The choreographer Jessica Lang, scouting for dancers, was impressed: “He’s not afraid to push boundaries.”', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/16/arts/16JAMESWHITESIDE-triptych/16JAMESWHITESIDE-triptych-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/16/arts/16JAMESWHITESIDE-triptych/16JAMESWHITESIDE-triptych-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/16/arts/16JAMESWHITESIDE-triptych/16JAMESWHITESIDE-triptych-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/16/arts/16JAMESWHITESIDE-triptych/16JAMESWHITESIDE-triptych-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 300, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name