ph': 'As the curtain rises on “Black Diamond” by Danish Dance Theater, a man lies on the stage, menaced by two figures wearing mesh bags over their heads. As a sad little flurry of confetti falls, more figures slink in wearing long black coats, the men bare chested. Sometimes, they jerk like poorly programmed robots or their fingers scurry over their arms like spiders. It’s enough to make you wonder, “Exactly which bad movie is this trying to be?”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/15/arts/15DANISHDANCE1/15DANISHDANCE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 395, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/15/arts/15DANISHDANCE1/15DANISHDANCE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 395}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/15/arts/15DANISHDANCE1/15DANISHDANCE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 674, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/15/arts/15DANISHDANCE1/15DANISHDANCE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1349, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/15/arts/15DANISHDANCE1/15DANISHDANCE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/15/arts/15DANISHDANCE1/15DANISHDANCE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/15/arts/15DANISHDANCE1/15DANISHDANCE1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'cr