ear run of declining annual budget deficits had halted: The shortfall for the fiscal year that ended Sept. 30 was $587 billion, an increase over last year in dollars and as a percentage of the economy.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Deficit Increases to $587 Billion, Ending Downward Trend', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ending Trend, U.S. Deficit Increases to $587 Billion', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Calmes, Jackie', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Budget (US)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Taxes (US)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-15T00:57:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jackie Calmes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jackie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Calmes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5d8f09d7-3807-5923-8a52-d0a0fe8c5f01', 'word_count': 468, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5d8f09d7-3807-5923-8a52-d0a0fe8c5f01'}, {'abstract': 'Dominant starters are no longer the norm, as playoff teams are relying more on an aggressive use of their bullpens to carry them to success.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/15/sports/baseball/playoffs-bullpen-relievers.html', 'snippet': 'Dominant starters are no longer the norm, as playoff teams are relying more on an aggressive use of their bullpens to carry them to success.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CLEVE