{'abstract': 'Spiders and webs from a chocolatier from Chicago arrive just in time for the holiday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/19/dining/chocolate-spider-webs-halloween-treats.html', 'snippet': 'Spiders and webs from a chocolatier from Chicago arrive just in time for the holiday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Just one bite and you’re trapped — you may have to finish an entire one of these smart, generous treats. The four-inch chocolate webs, complete with spider, are fashioned by Veruca Chocolates in Chicago and come three flavors to the box. Gilded dark chocolate is tangy with sea salt, milk chocolate is brushed with silver and studded with crunchy candied bits, and caramelized white chocolate has salt and cacao nibs throughout: Spider Web Bars, box of three, $16.50, mouth.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/19/dining/19-BURNER-TREAT/19-BURNER-TREAT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/19/dining/19-BURNER-TREAT/19-BURNER-TREAT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/19/dining/19-BURNER-TREAT/19-BURNER-TREAT-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/19/dining/19-BURNER-TREAT/19-BURNER-TREAT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/19/dining/19-BURNER-TREAT/19-BURNER-TREAT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit'