, 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/18/arts/music/andrew-cyrille-new-vanguard.html', 'snippet': 'With his two new albums, “The Declaration of Musical Independence” and “Proximity,” this jazz drummer displays his insight and ingenuity.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Andrew Cyrille opens one of his two new albums, “The Declaration of Musical Independence,” with a syncopated figure on a snare drum, as taut and riveting as a military cadence. Then he adds cymbals and kick drum, giving the phrase a sinuous curve just as the rest of the band enters. What they’re playing is “Coltrane Time,” an obscure piece by John Coltrane, and Mr. Cyrille shows the way forward with a regal, flowing self-possession.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/18/arts/18CYRILLE/18CYRILLE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 857, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/18/arts/18CYRILLE/18CYRILLE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 857}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/18/arts/18CYRILLE/18CYRILLE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 717, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/18/arts/18CYRILLE/18CYRILLE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1434, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/18/arts/18CYRILLE/18CYRILLE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/18/arts/18CYRILLE/18CYRILLE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheigh