Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/27400cb0-7b18-533e-ae54-23aeafdda6ba', 'word_count': 354, 'uri': 'nyt://article/27400cb0-7b18-533e-ae54-23aeafdda6ba'}, {'abstract': 'It’s time to stop companies — like Amazon, Boeing and Coca-Cola — from damaging the economy by legally shirking taxes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/18/opinion/the-big-companies-that-avoid-taxes.html', 'snippet': 'It’s time to stop companies — like Amazon, Boeing and Coca-Cola — from damaging the economy by legally shirking taxes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Donald Trump has become the country’s most notorious tax shirker. And while his long avoidance of federal income taxes is extreme, it’s also part of a larger problem.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/07/15/timestopics/sub2-leonhardt-topics/sub2-leonhardt-topics-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/07/15/timestopics/sub2-leonhardt-topics/sub2-leonhardt-topics-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/07/15/timestopics/sub2-leonhardt-topics/sub2-leonhardt-topics-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/07/15/timestopics/sub2-leonhardt-topics/sub2-leonhardt-topics-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1290, 'width': 1289, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/07/15/timestopics/sub2-leonhardt-top