al forays into other topics, Mr. Trump unveiled a policy proposal intended to strengthen his populist, anti-Washington appeal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'COLORADO SPRINGS — Donald J. Trump called for congressional term limits during a swing out West on Tuesday, part of an effort to push a raw outsider message in the closing weeks of the presidential campaign.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Donald Trump, Honing Outsider Message, Backs Term Limits for Congress', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Term Limits (Political Office)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Colorado', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Colorado Springs (Colo)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-19T00:55:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ashley Parker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ashley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Parker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/36463881-3a85-522a-9dba-0d482f4a72ab', 'word_count': 797, 'uri': 'nyt://article/36463881-3a85-522a-9dba-0d482f4a72ab'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Mikels cranked out an endless stream of bloody shockers, sci-fi thrillers, action films and jiggle-fests.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/19/movies/ted-mikels-dead.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Mikels cranked out an endless stream of bloody shockers, sci-fi thrillers, action films and jiggle-fests.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ted V. Mikels, the producer and director of dozens of ultra-low-budget horror and exploitation films, notably the 1960s cult favorites “The Astro-Zombies” and “The Corpse Grinders,” died on Sunday at his home in Las Vegas. He was 87.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/21/arts/21mikels-obit-1/19mikels-obit-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 366, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/21/arts/21mikels-obit-1/19mikels-obit-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 366}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/21/arts/21mikels-obit-1/19mikels-obit-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 625, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/21/arts/21mikels-obit-1/19mikels-obit-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1250, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/21/arts/21mikels-obit-1/mikels-obit-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/21/arts/21mikels-obit-1/mikels-obit-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/21/arts/21mikels-obit-1/mikels-obit-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Ted V. Mikels, Master of Low-Budget Cult Favorites, Dies at 87', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ted V. Mikels, Film Master of the Gory, the Buxom and the Cheesy, Dies at 87', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mikels, Ted V (1929-2016)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Astro-Zombies (Movie)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Doll Squad (Movie)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Corpse Grinders (Movie)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-19T01:05:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Grimes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Grimes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/212c2775-6800-5665-842e-4242705d5dfd', 'word_count': 1108, 'uri': 'nyt://article/212c2775-6800-5665-842e-4242705d5dfd'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Jones was working as a school janitor when he mailed an unsolicited, fictionalized war story to The New Yorker. In short time he became a literary sensation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/19/books/thom-jones-dead.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Jones was working as a school janitor when he mailed an unsolicited, fictionalized war story to The New Yorker. In short time he became a literary sensation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Thom Jones grew up in a gritty Illinois factory town. His father abandoned the family and was later committed to a mental institution, where he hanged himself. When Thom was still a teenager, he joined the Marines. Savagely beaten in a boxing match at Camp Pendleton, Calif., and mistakenl