nizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-19T07:30:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alexander Burns and Matt Flegenheimer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alexander', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Burns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Flegenheimer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8f9d5051-d931-5207-847f-64a675b236a7', 'word_count': 1537, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8f9d5051-d931-5207-847f-64a675b236a7'}, {'abstract': 'The film, which captures a live stage performance by Mr. Moore, is not a rollicking attack on the Republican nominee but a paean to Hillary Clinton.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/20/movies/review-michael-moore-in-trumpland.html', 'snippet': 'The film, which captures a live stage performance by Mr. Moore, is not a rollicking attack on the Republican nominee but a paean to Hillary Clinton.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If the news that the documentarian Michael Moore was releasing a surprise film called “Michael Moore in TrumpLand” had you expecting a rollicking, full-force attack on Donald J. Trump, prepare to be disappointed. Mr. Moore, one of filmmaking’s best-known provocateurs, seems to be decidedly uninterested in provoking anyone with this new offering, which had its hastily arranged premiere Tuesday night at the IFC Center in Greenwich Village. The film is not an attack on Mr. Trump, but instead a paean to his opponent in the presidential contest, Hillary Clinton.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/20/arts/20TRUMPLAND/20TRUMPLAND3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/20/arts/20TRUMPLAND/20TRUMPLAND3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/20/arts/20TRUMPLAND/20TRUMPLAND3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/20/arts/20TRUMPLAND/20TRUMPLAND3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1080, 'width': 1919, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/20/arts/20TRUMPLAND/20TRUMPLAND3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/20/arts/20TRUMPLAND/20TRUMPLAND3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/20/arts/20TRUMPLAND/20TRUMPLAND3-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: ‘Michael Moore in TrumpLand’ Isn’t About Donald Trump', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '‘TrumpLand’ Isn’t Really About Trump', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Michael Moore in TrumpLand (Movie)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Moore, Michael (1954- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'na