one, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/693a7eac-fb14-523d-9978-398e3f2d2e52', 'word_count': 1305, 'uri': 'nyt://article/693a7eac-fb14-523d-9978-398e3f2d2e52'}, {'abstract': 'The actress on working with her best friend, imagining what famous people carry in their bags and why she wouldn’t have wanted any other presidential candidate on “Broad City.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/23/magazine/abbi-jacobson-didnt-expect-hillary-clinton-to-come-on-her-show.html', 'snippet': 'The actress on working with her best friend, imagining what famous people carry in their bags and why she wouldn’t have wanted any other presidential candidate on “Broad City.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'You and your best friend, Ilana Glazer, are the creators and stars of Comedy Central’s “Broad City,” in which you play best friends. Does it feel weird whenever you’re not working with her? We’ve managed to create this really cool working relationship where our other projects inspire each other. But this is the longest we’ve gone where we haven’t seen each other. It’s been, like, a month and a half.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '54', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/23/magazine/23talk/23talk-articleLarge-v6.jpg', 'height': 1196, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/23/magazine/23talk/23talk-articleLarge-v6.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1196}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/23/magazine/23talk/23talk-jumbo-v6.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 514, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/23/magazine/23ta