bstract': 'Our critic walks you through this pure-dance masterpiece, which will be presented beginning on Wednesday by American Ballet Theater.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/20/arts/dance/symphonic-variations-frederick-ashton-american-ballet-theater.html', 'snippet': 'Our critic walks you through this pure-dance masterpiece, which will be presented beginning on Wednesday by American Ballet Theater.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the great plotless classical ballets, the prime subject is dancing itself. That’s true of the British choreographer Frederick Ashton’s “Symphonic Variations,” one of the purest pure-dance classics ever made. Created by Ashton in 1946 as his first work for the Covent Garden opera house, today “Symphonic Variations” is danced all around the world. After a 10-year gap, it returns to repertory at American Ballet Theater on Wednesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/19/arts/19SYMPHONIC/19SYMPHONIC-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/19/arts/19SYMPHONIC/19SYMPHONIC-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/19/arts/19SYMPHONIC/19SYMPHONIC-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/19/arts/19SYMPHONIC/19SYMPHONIC-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 607, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/19/arts/19SYMPHONIC/19SYMPHONIC-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 607}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type':