ue': 'BalletCollective', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Skirball Center for the Performing Arts', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schumacher, Troy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ramsey, James (1977- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Arnaiz, Carlos', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-19T14:34:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Siobhan Burke', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Siobhan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Burke', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/71f3070a-a0a5-5417-ac6a-3ccc0f01e4fe', 'word_count': 151, 'uri': 'nyt://article/71f3070a-a0a5-5417-ac6a-3ccc0f01e4fe'}, {'abstract': 'Her Oct. 25 show at Barclays Center also includes Maddie Ziegler, Miguel and AlunaGeorge.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/23/arts/music/sia-furler-a-shy-woman-hiding-under-a-big-wig.html', 'snippet': 'Her Oct. 25 show at Barclays Center also includes Maddie Ziegler, Miguel and AlunaGeorge.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sia Furler, singer-songwriter turned megahit collaborator turned victim-to-victory pop belter, is shy onstage. She sings her hits, like “Chandelier,” in a torn, slurred voice while keeping still and hiding under a giant wig. But there’s action onstage: choreographic vignettes featuring the dynamo Maddie Ziegler, whose frenetic moves and flickering expressions ramp up the songs’ emotional stakes. Sharing a bill with her in Brooklyn is a decidedly more carnal performer: Miguel, who knocks himself out onstage like an old-school soul showman with a decidedly modern repertory, personalizing rock, R&B and hip-hop as he merges seduction with the pride of a cross-cultural outsider. Also on the bill is AlunaGeorge, which slips a streak of female empowerment into its dance tunes. (Tuesday, Oct. 25, Barclays Center; barclayscenter.com.)', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/23/arts/23WEEKAHEADPOP/23WEEKAHEADPOP-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 770, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/23/arts/23WEEKAHEADPOP/23WEEKAHEADPOP-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 770}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/23/arts/23WEEKAHEADPOP/23WEEKAHEADPOP-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 798, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/23/arts/23WEEKAHEADPOP/23WEEKAHEADPOP-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1596, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/23/arts/23WEEKAHEADPOP/23WEEKAHEADPOP-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/23/arts/23WEEKAHEADPOP/23WEEKAHEADPOP-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/23/arts/23WEEKAHEADPOP/23WEEKAHEADPOP-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sia Furler, a Shy Woman Hiding Under a Big Wig', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Pop; A Shy Woman Under a Big Wig', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', '