ashion/peels-nyc-clothing-brand-work-shirts.html', 'snippet': 'Jerome Peel, whose shirts have become popular with skateboarders and fashion editors, began by designing for his dad.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Growing up in the suburbs of West Palm Beach, Jerome Peel spent hours watching his father fix old Hondas and dirt bikes. “He’d be wearing this work shirt,” Peel recalls. “Just that blue shirt, unbuttoned, with a tank top tucked into his jeans. That was the coolest look to me.” Last year, Peel was inspired to launch Peels NYC, a unisex line comprised of work shirts and utilitarian garments that pays homage to hard workers.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/19/t-magazine/fashion/19tmag-peels-slide-KWCB/19tmag-peels-slide-KWCB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/19/t-magazine/fashion/19tmag-peels-slide-KWCB/19tmag-peels-slide-KWCB-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/19/t-magazine/fashion/19tmag-peels-slide-KWCB/19tmag-peels-slide-KWCB-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/19/t-magazine/fashion/19tmag-peels-slide-KWCB/19tmag-peels-slide-KWCB-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/19/t-magazine/fashion/19tmag-peels-slide-KWCB/19tmag-peels-slide-KWCB-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url':