ier League meets Barcelona, a player is getting sent off. Manchester City showed it was no exception in a 4-0 shutout.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/20/sports/soccer/barcelona-manchester-city-lionel-messi.html', 'snippet': 'Whenever an emissary of the Premier League meets Barcelona, a player is getting sent off. Manchester City showed it was no exception in a 4-0 shutout.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BARCELONA, Spain — Claudio Bravo is not alone. He would have felt that way, of course, as he trudged off the field at Camp Nou, disconsolate and deaf to the warm ovation afforded him by Barcelona’s fans. He certainly felt that way in the locker room as the dust cleared on Manchester City’s humbling 4-0 defeat and even his manager, Pep Guardiola, acknowledged that Bravo, City’s goalkeeper, was “sad.”', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/20/sports/20-Y-SOCCER-1/20-Y-SOCCER-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/20/sports/20-Y-SOCCER-1/20-Y-SOCCER-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/20/sports/20-Y-SOCCER-1/20-Y-SOCCER-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/20/sports/20-Y-SOCCER-1/20-Y-SOCCER-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/20/sports/20-Y-SOCCER-1/20-Y-SOCCER-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thum