 a Hollywood celebrity tells you it is, “Before the Flood” feels out of phase. It’s a documentary in which Leonardo DiCaprio sounds the alarm about global warming, something that could not possibly have escaped anyone’s attention in recent years and is at this point probably beyond discussion: Either you think climate change is real or you don’t, and the battle lines aren’t likely to be shifted by an earnest movie star.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/21/arts/21BEFOREFLOOD/21BEFOREFLOOD-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 470, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/21/arts/21BEFOREFLOOD/21BEFOREFLOOD-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 470}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/21/arts/21BEFOREFLOOD/21BEFOREFLOOD-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 803, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/21/arts/21BEFOREFLOOD/21BEFOREFLOOD-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1561, 'width': 1991, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/21/arts/21BEFOREFLOOD/21BEFOREFLOOD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/21/arts/21BEFOREFLOOD/21BEFOREFLOOD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/21/arts/21BEFOREFLOOD/21BEFOREFLOOD-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumb