tendees certainly did.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/23/fashion/postscript-bill-cunningham-memorial.html', 'snippet': 'The invitation for the photographer’s memorial said “Dress for Bill.” Some attendees certainly did.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Monday afternoon, roughly four months after he died at age 87, more than 1,000 people gathered at Carnegie Hall to pay tribute to the longtime New York Times photographer Bill Cunningham. Fashion world notables like Ralph Lauren, Anna Wintour, Michael Kors, Vera Wang, Naomi Campbell and Jenna Lyons attended, but so did dozens of people — some famous, some decidedly not — whom Mr. Cunningham had photographed over the years for his weekly “On the Street” and “Evening Hours” columns. The invitation said “Dress for Bill.” Some attendees certainly did.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Postscript: Bill Cunningham', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Postscript: Bill Cunningham', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Emmrich, Stuart', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cunningham, Bill', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Carnegie Hall', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-20T21:01:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stuart Emmrich', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stuart', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Emmrich', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b52b912e-4583-5ef3-972e-dadae2ead97