ans.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/21/us/politics/voter-registration-effort-spurs-an-inquiry-in-indiana.html', 'snippet': 'The State Police are investigating incomplete forms submitted by a project aimed at raising ballot participation among African-Americans.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HAMMOND, Ind. — With accusations of rigging and voter fraud hanging over this year’s elections, alarms are set off by the mere suggestion of irregularities in the registration and voting process. So when questions were raised in Indiana this year about suspicious registration forms, the matter quickly snowballed, leading to a sweeping investigation, supported by the Republican secretary of state and led by the State Police.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/21/us/21INDIANA/21INDIANA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 846, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/21/us/21INDIANA/21INDIANA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 846}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/21/us/21INDIANA/21INDIANA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 727, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/21/us/21INDIANA/21INDIANA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1124, 'width': 797, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/21/us/21INDIANA/21INDIANA-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/21/us/21INDIANA/21INDIANA-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75