:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/7c48310d-54b2-52f8-a44b-ee4d8a08d07e', 'word_count': 524, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7c48310d-54b2-52f8-a44b-ee4d8a08d07e'}, {'abstract': 'Trump is bereft of patriotism, and seems to hate the country he wants to lead.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/21/opinion/campaign-stops/american-gut-check.html', 'snippet': 'Trump is bereft of patriotism, and seems to hate the country he wants to lead.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You can imagine Donald Trump sitting on his golden throne in the Las Vegas hotel he built with all that cheap Chinese steel, imagine him trying to keep every molecule of reality from entering the room. He’s seething, because his numbers are cratering. And yet, in his mind he cannot be losing. So, everything is rigged.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/21/opinion/21EganWeb/21EganWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/21/opinion/21EganWeb/21EganWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/21/opinion/21EganWeb/21EganWeb-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/21/opinion/21EganWeb/21EganWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/21/opinion/21EganWeb/21EganWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xl