le/0d9b96bf-4a2f-5317-bd14-c9684692db31'}, {'abstract': 'I thought that by keeping my mother’s bakery open I wouldn’t have to face the truth that she was gone.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/21/well/family/baking-cookies-in-my-mothers-kitchen.html', 'snippet': 'I thought that by keeping my mother’s bakery open I wouldn’t have to face the truth that she was gone.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I keep a photo on my nightstand of my mom and me making handmade biscotti when I was little. I’m wearing an oversize apron, my cheeks as voluminous as her ’80s-style hot-rollered hair. The photo is a reminder of a joyful time when I still liked making cookies and I still had my mom.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/21/well/family/well-family-biscotti/well-family-biscotti-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/21/well/family/well-family-biscotti/well-family-biscotti-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/21/well/family/well-family-biscotti/well-family-biscotti-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/21/well/family/well-family-biscotti/well-family-biscotti-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 548, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/21/well/family/well-family-biscotti/well-family-biscotti-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 548}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/21/well/family/well-family-biscot