thump was shaking the walls of the club, but the room was so packed it was difficult to dance. Unable to move their legs, dancers resorted to simply pointing to the ceiling in time to the music (“Do you want to get wasted, wasted”). At one point a huge, muscled gentleman pulled out a full-size trombone — if he didn’t work there, I’m not sure how he got that thing past security — and began playing along to the music.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/23/travel/23FRUGAL1/23FRUGAL1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/23/travel/23FRUGAL1/23FRUGAL1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/23/travel/23FRUGAL1/23FRUGAL1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/23/travel/23FRUGAL1/23FRUGAL1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/23/travel/23FRUGAL1/23FRUGAL1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/23/travel/23FRUGAL1/23FRUGAL1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/23/travel/23FRUGAL1/23FRUGAL1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Partying in South Beach Like It’s $19.99', 'kicker': 'Frugal Traveler', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tonight I’m Gonna Party Like It’s $19.99', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Peterson, Lucas', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Beach (Miami Beach, Fla)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bars and Nightclubs', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Budget Travel', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Miami Beach (Fla)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-21T10:00:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lucas Peterson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lucas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Peterson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ae971dba-9ab4-5563-bc97-da0f280d41ce', 'word_count': 1487, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ae971dba-9ab4-5563-bc97-da0f280d41ce'}, {'abstract': 'The two floors of Palácio Chiado offer seven stops, each spinoffs of existing restaurants, from casual tapas to fancy seafood.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/23/travel/lisbon-restaurants-food-palacio-chiado.html', 'snippet': 'The two floors of Palácio Chiado offer seven stops, each spinoffs of existing restaurants, from casual tapas to fancy seafood.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As we entered under a stone archway hugging two oversize wooden doors, a nattily dressed man motioned us through a glass door, then thrust black pocket-size charge cards into our hands. Those cards (on which you run a tab and pay on the way out