at Ground Zero', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Letters to the Editor', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Letters', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-21T15:16:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'BookReview', 'section_name': 'Books', 'subsection_name': 'Book Review', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/663b316f-35f1-5e74-8fe8-db9a602654dc', 'word_count': 839, 'uri': 'nyt://article/663b316f-35f1-5e74-8fe8-db9a602654dc'}, {'abstract': 'New York Review Books Classics is hoping to restore the English novelist’s visibility for good.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/23/books/review/henry-greens-latest-comeback.html', 'snippet': 'New York Review Books Classics is hoping to restore the English novelist’s visibility for good.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The writer Henry Green’s fashionability has gone through more phases than the moon. As far back as 1960, Robert Gorham Davis was writing in the Book Review that Green “has shown more subtlety and virtuosity than any other novelist of his generation in England,” but had been kept from “the recognition he deserves.”', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/23/books/review/1023-BKS-OpenBook/1023-BKS-OpenBook-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 263, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/23/books/review/1023-BKS-OpenBook/1023-BKS-OpenBook-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 263}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'image