': 'nyt://article/f1eebe50-46d9-5f59-a44b-b0b594672437'}, {'abstract': 'Making sense of the last days of an improbable campaign.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/21/magazine/trump-in-april-if-i-lose-ill-let-it-all-out.html', 'snippet': 'Making sense of the last days of an improbable campaign.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As Donald Trump’s improbable candidacy careens through its final month, it might be easier to list the public figures who haven’t suffered his slings and arrows than to list the ones who have. Among the latest is the House speaker, Paul Ryan, who told House Republicans last week that he was done defending Trump (though not rescinding his endorsement of him).', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/21/magazine/21mag-trump-1/21mag-trump-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/21/magazine/21mag-trump-1/21mag-trump-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/21/magazine/21mag-trump-1/21mag-trump-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/21/magazine/21mag-trump-1/21mag-trump-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/21/magazine/21mag-trump-1/21mag-trump-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/21/magazine/21mag-trump-1/21mag-trump-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75