raph': 'John Boehner, the former speaker of the House of Representatives, may find that his month-old gig as a board member at Reynolds American does not last as long as he expected. British American Tobacco is offering $47 billion for the 58 percent of the Camel cigarette maker that it does not already own.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tobacco Giant Reynolds American Unlikely to Get a Sweeter Offer', 'kicker': 'Breakingviews', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lorillard Tobacco Co', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Reynolds American Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Boehner, John A', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-21T21:43:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kevin Allison', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kevin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Allison', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2c7a6817-db88-5149-9d11-6afcebe73bdb', 'word_count': 401, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2c7a6817-db88-5149-9d11-6afcebe73bdb'}, {'abstract': 'The Swiss video artist is taking over the entire New Museum with an unconventional retrospective, her most prominent American stage yet.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/22/arts/design/pipilotti-rist-provoking-with-delight.html', 'snippet': 'The Swiss video artist is taking over the entire New Museum with an unconventional retrospective, her most prominent American stage yet.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Swiss artist Pipilotti Rist may have been raised in the birthplace of Calvinism, with its reputation for austerity and penitence. But you wouldn’t know it by her work, or almost anything she has touched in an influential career spanning three decades. She titled one of her books “Congratulations!” and another, bound in pink velvet, “The Tender Room.” Her hallucinatory 2009 feature film, “Pepperminta,” told the tale, as she once described it, of “a young woman and her friends on a quest to find the right color combinations and with these colors they can free other people from fear.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/22/arts/22PIPILOTTI4/22PIPILOTTI4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/22/arts/22PIPILOTTI4/22PIPILOTTI4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/22/arts/22PIPILOTTI4/22PIPILOTTI4-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/22/arts/22PIPILOTTI4/22PIPILOTTI4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 424, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/22/arts/22PIPILOTTI4/22PIPILOTTI4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 424}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/22/arts/22PIPILOTTI4/22PIPILOTTI4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 723, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/22/arts/22PIPILOTTI4/22PIPILOTTI4-superJumbo.jpg', 'h