ditor.html', 'snippet': 'Is the way to a young reader’s heart through the earbuds? The Times is hoping that may be the case.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE NEW YORK TIMES is used to a change of costume. When the website launched 20 years ago, Times editors reimagined what the Gray Lady would look like draped in digital sheen. When video arrived several years later, they imagined their journalism in motion. A decade after that, they squeezed it into a cellphone, making it fast, sleek and slim, but, as with the rest, still recognizable as “The Times.”', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/23/opinion/sunday/23publiceditor/23publiceditor-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/23/opinion/sunday/23publiceditor/23publiceditor-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/23/opinion/sunday/23publiceditor/23publiceditor-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/23/opinion/sunday/23publiceditor/23publiceditor-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 635, 'width': 590, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/23/opinion/sunday/23publiceditor/23publiceditor-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 635, 'width': 590, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Taking the Plunge Into the Podcast Pool', 'kicker': 'The Public Editor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Taking the Plu