kely to outclass the rest of the league once again.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Golden State Warriors’ dream season, in which the team won 73 games and point guard Stephen Curry became the N.B.A.’s first unanimous most valuable player, crashed and burned at the hands of LeBron James, Kyrie Irving and the Cleveland Cavaliers. The loss was so unexpected that it started a meme online, with “the Warriors blew a 3-1 lead” used as a rallying cry in any bleak situation.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/23/sports/23NBAPREVIEW1/23NBAPREVIEW1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/23/sports/23NBAPREVIEW1/23NBAPREVIEW1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/23/sports/23NBAPREVIEW1/23NBAPREVIEW1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/23/sports/23NBAPREVIEW1/23NBAPREVIEW1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 376, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/23/sports/23NBAPREVIEW1/23NBAPREVIEW1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 376}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/23/sports/23NBAPREVIEW1/23NBAPREVIEW1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 642, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/23/sports/23NBAPREVIEW1/23NBAPREVIEW1-superJumbo.jpg', 'hei