ct': 'Ryan Fitzpatrick, benched last week, took over when Geno Smith hurt his knee in the second quarter. Somehow, the confusion seemed to catalyze the Jets’ attack.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/24/sports/new-york-jets-baltimore-ravens.html', 'snippet': 'Ryan Fitzpatrick, benched last week, took over when Geno Smith hurt his knee in the second quarter. Somehow, the confusion seemed to catalyze the Jets’ attack.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. — The Jets had promised rebirth. Change was afoot: a new quarterback, a more aggressive defense, a lighter schedule. They were done repeating mistakes.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/24/sports/24subJETSweb1/24subJETSweb1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/24/sports/24subJETSweb1/24subJETSweb1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/24/sports/24subJETSweb1/24subJETSweb1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/24/sports/24subJETSweb1/24subJETSweb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 395, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/24/sports/24subJETSweb1/24subJETSweb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 395}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/24/sports/24subJETSweb1/24subJETSweb1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 674, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank':