Paige were the first black players to be part of a major league championship.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/24/sports/baseball/cleveland-indians-in-1948-a-story-of-integration.html', 'snippet': 'Larry Doby and Satchel Paige were the first black players to be part of a major league championship.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Satchel Paige, the greatest pitcher ever excluded from Major League Baseball, arrived at Cleveland’s Municipal Stadium for a tryout with the Indians in July 1948. A Negro leagues legend believed to be in his early 40s, Paige faced one batter, Lou Boudreau, who was both the Indians’ manager and shortstop.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/24/sports/24satchel2sub/24satchel2sub-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/24/sports/24satchel2sub/24satchel2sub-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/24/sports/24satchel2sub/24satchel2sub-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/24/sports/24satchel2sub/24satchel2sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 814, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/24/sports/24satchel2sub/24satchel2sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 814}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/24/sports/24satchel2sub/24satchel2sub-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 755, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'l