ng/white-truffle-urbani.html', 'snippet': 'Truffle Lab on the Upper West Side celebrates the treasured delicacy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s white truffle season, and the treasured tubers, which can fetch up to $150 an ounce, are perfuming plates of pasta in many restaurants. Urbani Truffles, a major supplier, has scheduled cooking classes at the Truffle Lab in its headquarters on the Upper West Side. Pasta with white truffles will be featured from 6 to 8 p.m. on Tuesday, Nov. 16 and Dec. 13; pizza with truffles will be taught from noon to 2 p.m. on Nov. 5 and Dec. 3; and a truffle brunch is scheduled from noon to 2 p.m. on Nov. 19. Each white truffle class includes a tasting with wine: Truffle Lab, $125 to $135, Urbani Truffles, 10 West End Avenue (West 60th Street), 212-247-8800, urbani.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/26/dining/26BURNERTRUFFLE/26BURNERTRUFFLE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/26/dining/26BURNERTRUFFLE/26BURNERTRUFFLE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/26/dining/26BURNERTRUFFLE/26BURNERTRUFFLE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/26/dining/26BURNERTRUFFLE/26BURNERTRUFFLE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/26/dining/26BURNERTRUFFLE/26BURNERTRUFFLE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'cred