ou-to-the-grand-canyon-after-hes-sung.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Lamas, now in “The Fantasticks,” talks about his life in and out of show business and what brought him back to the stage.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Fans of the actor Lorenzo Lamas can be forgiven for thinking that his latest role might be that of a guy who seduces a woman with one hand and fires a bazooka with the other. El Gallo, after all, sounds like one of the chiseled hotties Mr. Lamas has portrayed in action films like “Snake Eater” and “Bounty Tracker.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/25/arts/25LAMAS/25LAMAS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/25/arts/25LAMAS/25LAMAS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/25/arts/25LAMAS/25LAMAS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/25/arts/25LAMAS/25LAMAS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/25/arts/25LAMAS/25LAMAS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/25/arts/25LAMAS/25LAMAS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/25/arts/25LAMAS/25LAMAS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'supe