lso plans to sell some businesses as it seeks to raise $5.4 billion of fresh capital to shore up its balance sheet.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/26/business/dealbook/monte-dei-paschi-italy-bank.html', 'snippet': 'The Italian lender also plans to sell some businesses as it seeks to raise $5.4 billion of fresh capital to shore up its balance sheet.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Banca Monte dei Paschi di Siena, the beleaguered Italian lender, said on Tuesday that it would slash jobs, close branches and sell some businesses as it seeks to convince investors to back its plan to raise new capital.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/26/business/26DB-MONTEPASCHI-1/26DB-MONTEPASCHI-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/26/business/26DB-MONTEPASCHI-1/26DB-MONTEPASCHI-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/26/business/26DB-MONTEPASCHI-1/26DB-MONTEPASCHI-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/26/business/26DB-MONTEPASCHI-1/26DB-MONTEPASCHI-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/26/business/26DB-MONTEPASCHI-1/26DB-MONTEPASCHI-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/26/business/26DB-MONTEPASCHI-1/26DB-MONTEPASCHI-1-thumbStandar