-he-may-cry-over-his-unlikely-return-to-action.html', 'snippet': 'Joe Maddon likes to take chances: Schwarber, who hasn’t faced major league pitching since April, will bat fifth in Game One of the World Series.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CLEVELAND — It was not until last week that Kyle Schwarber realized he might be able to play in the World Series. He had visited the doctor almost monthly since the mid-April operation that was expected to end his season, and all along the target was for him to be ready by next spring training.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/26/sports/26-Y-NOTEBOOK-1/26-Y-NOTEBOOK-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/26/sports/26-Y-NOTEBOOK-1/26-Y-NOTEBOOK-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/26/sports/26-Y-NOTEBOOK-1/26-Y-NOTEBOOK-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/26/sports/26-Y-NOTEBOOK-1/26-Y-NOTEBOOK-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/26/sports/26-Y-NOTEBOOK-1/26-Y-NOTEBOOK-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/26/sports/26-Y-NOTEBOOK-1/26-Y-NOTEBOOK-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'ima