.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Australia’s Poisonous Refugee Policy', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A poisonous refugee policy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Refugees and Displaced Persons', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Rights Violations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Australia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-26T13:33:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Waleed Aly', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Waleed', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Aly', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/e4c4c706-b688-5bbf-ac04-cbbf70f5da21', 'word_count': 909, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e4c4c706-b688-5bbf-ac04-cbbf70f5da21'}, {'abstract': 'Less than half of young Americans in a Harvard Institute of Politics poll said they trusted Mrs. Clinton more than Donald J. Trump to improve the economy and combat terrorism.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/27/us/politics/hillary-clinton-gains-some-ground-among-young-voters-poll-finds.html', 'snippet': 'Less than half of young Americans in a Harvard Institute of Politics poll said they trusted Mrs. Clinton more than Donald J. Trump to improve the economy and combat terrorism.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hillary Clinton has strengthened her position slightly among young voters, but she has struggled to take full advantage of Donald J. Trump’s rising unpopularity, a new poll shows.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/27/us/27fd-harvardpoll/27fd-harvardpoll-thumbS