ation Case', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pregnancy and Childbirth', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Justice Department', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Florence (Ky)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Riley, Samantha J (1985- )', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trischler, Lyndi J (1983- )', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Equal Employment Opportunity Commission', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-26T19:59:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Pérez-Peña', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pérez-Peña', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2381ecee-5004-5212-8d42-1ac0d4df2dd2', 'word_count': 969, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2381ecee-5004-5212-8d42-1ac0d4df2dd2'}, {'abstract': 'In a call with investors, the chiefs of the companies noted that the combined trove of their consumer data would be useful to marketers and consumers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/27/business/media/targeted-advertising-time-warner-merger.html', 'snippet': 'In a call with investors, the chiefs of the companies noted that the combined trove of their consumer data would be useful to marketers and consumers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Targeting people with individualized TV commercials using cable or satellite boxes has been promoted as the future of television for at least a decade. But the business, known as addressable TV advertising, has remained on the fringes, usually limited to two minutes of local commercial time