ations', 'value': 'Time Warner Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television Sets and Media Devices', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bewkes, Jeffrey L', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-26T20:17:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sapna Maheshwari', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sapna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Maheshwari', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/18cadf61-f359-5133-86a7-2fb7f74019c7', 'word_count': 1238, 'uri': 'nyt://article/18cadf61-f359-5133-86a7-2fb7f74019c7'}, {'abstract': 'On this week’s podcast, Issa Rae (of the web series “Awkward Black Girl”) reads the story of a long-distance couple who grow so close on screen they decide to see if it will work in real life.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/26/fashion/town-hall-live-david-harbour-lucius-modern-love-podcast.html', 'snippet': 'On this week’s podcast, Issa Rae (of the web series “Awkward Black Girl”) reads the story of a long-distance couple who grow so close on screen they decide to see if it will work in real life.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Did you miss “Modern Love Live”? No worries. In this week’s podcast, we’re highlighting performances from the event, which took place Oct. 20 at Town Hall in New York. Hosted by Ophira Eisenberg of NPR, the evening featured readings by the actors Kate Burton (“Scandal”), David Harbour (“Stranger Things”) and Amber Tamblyn (“Dark Sparkler”), comedy from Michelle Buteau and music by Lucius.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/14/fashion/26MODERN/26MODERN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 417, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/05/14/fashion/26MODERN/26MODERN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 417}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/14/fashion/26MODERN/26MODERN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 711, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/14/fashion/26MODERN/26MODERN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 750, 'width': 1080, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/14/fashion/26MODERN/26MODERN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/05/14/fashion/26MODERN/26MODERN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/05/14/fashion/26MODERN/26MODERN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Modern Love Podcast: Live From New York', 'kicker': 'Modern Love', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Podcasts', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tamblyn, Amber', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Harbour, David', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-26T20:35:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '