o pharmaceutical price gouging. Mylan offered discount coupons.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The U.S. Is Standing in the Way of Cheaper Drugs for the Poor', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Cheaper drugs are possible', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prices (Fares, Fees and Rates)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs (Pharmaceuticals)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-27T11:24:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jason Cone and Raymond C. Offenheiser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jason', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Raymond', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'Offenheiser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/0c318136-949a-509b-bac0-58e46441917f', 'word_count': 904, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0c318136-949a-509b-bac0-58e46441917f'}, {'abstract': 'The European Parliament awarded Nadia Murad and Lamiya Aji Bashar its top human rights prize.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/28/world/middleeast/yazidi-women-isis-sakharov-prize.html', 'snippet': 'The European Parliament awarded Nadia Murad and Lamiya Aji Bashar its top human rights prize.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Nadia Murad and Lamiya Aji Bashar, two young Iraqis who escaped sexual slavery by the Islamic State and became advocates for women’s rights, were honored on Thursday with the Sakharov Prize for Freedom of Thought, th