w who you are, Prius owners). Then gasoline became cheap and hybrids began stacking up like so much cordwood on dealership lots. Some buyers still seek lofty miles-per-gallon numbers, but the clear trend has been toward bigger, thirsty vehicles. At least until gas hits $4 again.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Video Review: Ford Fusion Hybrid Combines Savings and Style', 'kicker': 'Driven', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ford Fusion Hybrid: A Fuel Saver That’s Roomy and Refined', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Electric and Hybrid Vehicles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ford Motor Co', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-27T15:59:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'subsection_name': 'New Cars', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tom Voelk', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tom', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Voelk', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c203807e-dbde-5dd2-86b1-a661199b2dc3', 'word_count': 763, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c203807e-dbde-5dd2-86b1-a661199b2dc3'}, {'abstract': 'From Harrisburg, Pa., to Memphis, Tenn., the brisket, sausage, pulled and chopped pork, and fried okra you should put on your plate.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/30/travel/13-essential-barbecue-bbq-stops.html', 'snippet': 'From Harrisburg, Pa., to Memphis, Tenn., the brisket, sausage, pulled and chopped pork, and fried okra you should put on your plate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you’re near Harrisburg, make a pit stop for sandwiches at the well-hidden ShakeDown BBQ (668 Firehouse Road, Grantville, Pa.; shakedownbbq.com). The menu changes regularly,