hina’s economic rebirth that pushes against the tide of prosperity.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/28/movies/crosscurrent-review.html', 'snippet': 'Yang Chao’s tale of a cargo boat owner’s trip from port to port is a meditation of China’s economic rebirth that pushes against the tide of prosperity.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Buckling beneath the weight of its director’s ambitions, Yang Chao’s “Crosscurrent” is spectacular to look at and a devil to decode. Cramming fantasy and mysticism, faith and history into a single riverboat journey, this dirgelike meditation on China’s painful economic rebirth dispenses with narrative in favor of semiotics.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/28/arts/28CROSSCURRENT1/28CROSSCURRENT1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/28/arts/28CROSSCURRENT1/28CROSSCURRENT1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/28/arts/28CROSSCURRENT1/28CROSSCURRENT1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/28/arts/28CROSSCURRENT1/28CROSSCURRENT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 251, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/28/arts/28CROSSCURRENT1/28CROSSCURRENT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 251}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/28/arts/28CROSSCURRENT1/28CROSSCURRENT1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 429, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo'