review/the-story-behind-this-weeks-best-sellers.html', 'snippet': 'The YouTube star Hannah Hart’s memoir, “Buffering,” enters the hardcover nonfiction list at No.4. It’s a sunny reckoning with some dark subjects.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Cheers: When Hannah Hart was a senior at Berkeley, in 2009, she wrote her literature thesis about memory and autobiography. “I’m really a big fan of nonfiction,” she said in a recent phone call from Los Angeles, where she lives. “I’ve always been really interested in it from an intellectual perspective as a genre. But then as a consumer, and as a person, I’ve always gotten so much from someone sharing their story.”', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/06/books/review/06insidelist/06insidelist-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 608, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/06/books/review/06insidelist/06insidelist-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 608}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/06/books/review/06insidelist/06insidelist-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 789, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/06/books/review/06insidelist/06insidelist-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 789, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/06/books/review/06insidelist/06insidelist-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/06/books/review/06insidelist/06insidelist-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thu