 weapons in October 1966, during the Cold War.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2016/10/28/1966-china-reports-perfect-test-of-a-guided-a-missile/', 'snippet': 'From the archives of The International Herald Tribune: The Communist government announces that it possesses nuclear weapons in October 1966, during the Cold War.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HONG KONG — The Chinese Communists announced today that they had test-fired a guided missile fitted with a nuclear warhead which exploded on target. China thus became a full-fledged member of the nuclear weapons club. The official New China News Agency declared that the test had taken place today “over China’s own territory” in a brief announcement claiming for the first time that China possessed “nuclear weapons.” Announcements of the previous three tests had referred only to “nuclear explosions.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/28/blogs/28oldiht-1966-chinamissiles/28oldiht-1966-chinamissiles-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 192, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/28/blogs/28oldiht-1966-chinamissiles/28oldiht-1966-chinamissiles-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 192}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/28/blogs/28oldiht-1966-chinamissiles/28oldiht-1966-chinamissiles-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 302, 'width': 946, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/28/blogs/28oldiht-1966-chinamissiles/28oldiht-1966-chinamissiles-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 302, 'width': 946, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url