 and concluded what other coveted players had: Dortmund has become soccer’s premier destination for young talent.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/29/sports/soccer/go-to-borussia-dortmund-young-man-and-maybe-even-stay.html', 'snippet': 'Ousmane Dembélé did his research and concluded what other coveted players had: Dortmund has become soccer’s premier destination for young talent.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DORTMUND, Germany — The choice in front of Ousmane Dembélé, a teenage French forward of almost limitless promise, was flattering and bewildering in equal measure. He had just turned 19, and he had only one season of senior-level soccer — with Rennes, a modest team in France’s top division — under his belt. Yet by last summer, he had become one of the most coveted players on the planet.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/29/sports/29DORTMUNDweb1/29DORTMUNDweb1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/29/sports/29DORTMUNDweb1/29DORTMUNDweb1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/29/sports/29DORTMUNDweb1/29DORTMUNDweb1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/29/sports/29DORTMUNDweb1/29DORTMUNDweb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 443, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/29/sports/29DORTMUNDweb1/29DORTMUNDweb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 443}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': No