el, one old and one new, illustrate how his choreography has shrunken from genuine provocation to lazy formulas.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/29/arts/dance/jerome-bel-naked-and-alive-then-clothed-and-dead.html', 'snippet': 'Two pieces by Mr. Bel, one old and one new, illustrate how his choreography has shrunken from genuine provocation to lazy formulas.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Many years ago, Jérôme Bel had some genuinely provocative ideas. In the second and final week that the Crossing The Line festival has been focusing on this French choreographer, those ideas were the revelation in the New York premiere of his early work “Jérôme Bel,” even as the premiere of his new, festival-commissioned “MoMA Dance Company” exhibited how his recent art has shrunken into lazy formulas.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/29/arts/29BELNOTEBOOK/29BELNOTEBOOK-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/29/arts/29BELNOTEBOOK/29BELNOTEBOOK-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/29/arts/29BELNOTEBOOK/29BELNOTEBOOK-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/29/arts/29BELNOTEBOOK/29BELNOTEBOOK-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1361, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/29/arts/29BELNOTEBOOK/29BELNOTEBOOK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'image