atrin Einhorn of The Times took a long-term look.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/29/world/canada/canada-today-new-challenges-for-syrian-refugees.html', 'snippet': 'Pleas from the relatives of Syrian refugees are testing the limits of Canadian sponsors. Jodi Kantor and Catrin Einhorn of The Times took a long-term look.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The struggles and dangers that refugees from Syria endure before reaching safe havens are now well known. For the second part of their insightful and often moving long-term look at Syrian refugees in Canada, Jodi Kantor and Catrin Einhorn were in Toronto, where they found an additional stress factor that newcomers faced after they arrived at their new homes.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/29/world/29canada-today/29canada-today-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/29/world/29canada-today/29canada-today-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/29/world/29canada-today/29canada-today-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/29/world/29canada-today/29canada-today-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/29/world/29canada-today/29canada-today-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/29/world/29canada-today/29canada-today-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType':