azz musician leads an octet for her show at ShapeShifter Lab in Brooklyn and looks forward to a new album.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/29/arts/music/mary-halvorson-away-with-you-interview.html', 'snippet': 'The jazz musician leads an octet for her show at ShapeShifter Lab in Brooklyn and looks forward to a new album.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There’s no other sound in music precisely like Mary Halvorson’s guitar, which she plays with a flinty attack, a spidery finesse and a shiver of wobbly delay. At National Sawdust in Brooklyn last Saturday, that sound was an unmistakable force during a prime-time stretch of John Zorn’s bagatelles marathon, which featured 20 groupings of musicians over a 10-hour concert sprawl.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/29/arts/29NEWVANGUARD/29NEWVANGUARD-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 606, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/29/arts/29NEWVANGUARD/29NEWVANGUARD-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 606}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/29/arts/29NEWVANGUARD/29NEWVANGUARD-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1015, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/29/arts/29NEWVANGUARD/29NEWVANGUARD-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2029, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/29/arts/29NEWVANGUARD/29NEWVANGUARD-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/29/arts/29N