inton-emails.html', 'snippet': 'A reader writes: “By releasing his letter 11 days before the election, the F.B.I. director is meddling in politics at Hooveresque levels.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'To the Editor:', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The F.B.I. and the Clinton Emails', 'kicker': 'Letters', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The F.B.I. and the Emails', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Hillary Rodham', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Bureau of Investigation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Comey, James B', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-28T21:13:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Letters', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/8dcc7527-fed8-5b2d-92a5-70c5a9441df0', 'word_count': 185, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8dcc7527-fed8-5b2d-92a5-70c5a9441df0'}, {'abstract': 'Troy Schumacher’s troupe, BalletCollective, cultivated a spontaneous mood in “What’s Next,” a triple bill of his works.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/29/arts/dance/review-a-group-of-young-dancers-conversing-with-their-feet-troy-schumacher-balletcollective.html', 'snippet': 'Troy Schumacher’s troupe, BalletCollective, cultivated a spontaneous mood in “What’s Next,” a triple bill of his works.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The seven New York City Ballet dancers who performed in BalletCollective’s “What Comes Next” program looked fresh, unaffected, contemporary. They (five women, two men) walked onto the stage on their heels, their manner casual. After a step or a sequence, they let their arms swing and stood on flat feet. They were not improvising, but the mood was spontaneous.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/29/arts/29BALLETCOLLECTIVE/29BALLETCOLLECTIVE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/29/arts/29BALLETCOLLECTIVE/29BALLETCOLLECTIVE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/29/arts/29BALLETCOLLECTIVE/29BALLETCOLLECTIVE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 679, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/29/arts/29BALLETCOLLECTIVE/29BALLETCOLLECTIVE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1358, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/29/arts/29BALLETCOLLECTIVE/29BALLETCOLLECTIVE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/29/arts/29BALLETCOLLECTIVE/29BALLETCOLLECTIVE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/29/arts/29BALLETCOLLECTIVE/29BALLETCOLLECTIVE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: A Group of Young Dancers, Conversing With their Feet', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Impulsive Young Performers, Conversing With Their Feet', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 1, '