.com/2016/10/29/us/politics/donald-trump-hillary-clinton.html', 'snippet': 'The F.B.I. director’s disclosure of an investigation of new emails interrupted Mrs. Clinton’s momentum as Mr. Trump and other Republicans sought to take advantage.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Everything was looking up for Hillary Clinton. She was riding high in the polls, even seeing an improvement on trustworthiness. She was sitting on $153 million in cash. At 12:37 p.m. Friday, her aides announced that she planned to campaign in Arizona, a state that a Democratic presidential candidate has carried only once since 1948.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘This Changes Everything’: Donald Trump Exults as Hillary Clinton’s Team Scrambles', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'With 11 Days to Go, Trump Says Revelation ‘Changes Everything’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Hillary Rodham', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classified Information and State Secrets', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'E-Mail', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Bureau of Investigation', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Abedin, Huma', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Weiner, Anthony D', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-28T23:53:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Amy Chozick and Patrick Healy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Amy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Chozick', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Healy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/89657164-ebc3-5d5a-b86d-a0764a5ac276', 'word_count': 1419, 'uri': 'nyt://article/89657164-ebc3-5d5a-b86d-a0764a5ac276'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the day for Saturday, October 29, 2016.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/29/todayspaper/quotation-of-the-day.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the day for Saturday, October 29, 2016.', 'lead_paragraph': '“It is extraordinary that we would see something like this just 11 days out from a presidential election.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2016-10-29T00:01:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Today’s Paper', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/49b41cab-4de1-50b2-a507-b4d0a4fff068', 'word_count': 49, 'uri': 'nyt://article/49b41cab-4de1-50b2-a507-b4d0a4fff068'}, {'abstract': 'James Comey’s failure to provide specifics about a new, potentially important development, less than two weeks before Election Day, is confounding.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/29/opinion/emails-again-this-time-with-anthony-weiner.html', 'snippet': 'James Comey’s failure to provide specifics about a new, potentially important development, less than two weeks before Election Day, is confounding.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Every time Americans start thinking nothing more can surprise them in this presidential campaign, something detonates to prove them wrong. So it was that on Friday, 11 days from Election Day, the F.B.I. director, James Come