7, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ec983cba-9e02-593a-9503-b27a2d1244d8'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Cranshaw won awards for public service announcements and campaigns that dealt with everything from genocide in Darfur to depression on campus.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/29/arts/television/sophia-cranshaw-died.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Cranshaw won awards for public service announcements and campaigns that dealt with everything from genocide in Darfur to depression on campus.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sophia Cranshaw, an MTV producer, director and writer who was honored for her campaigns against genocide, the stigma of mental illness and other sweeping social crises, died on Monday in Manhattan. She was 45.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/29/arts/29cranshaw-obit/29cranshaw-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 833, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/29/arts/29cranshaw-obit/29cranshaw-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 833}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/29/arts/29cranshaw-obit/29cranshaw-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 738, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/29/arts/29cranshaw-obit/29cranshaw-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1475, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/29/arts/29cranshaw-obit/29cranshaw-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/29/arts/29cranshaw-