e/24953169-1285-5580-a301-36ca3e31242c'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Rajoy is set to form a new conservative government next week, after two inconclusive national elections and 10 months of stalemate.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/30/world/europe/mariano-rajoy-re-elected-as-spains-prime-minister.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Rajoy is set to form a new conservative government next week, after two inconclusive national elections and 10 months of stalemate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MADRID — Mariano Rajoy was re-elected as Spain’s prime minister on Saturday, ending a bitter period of political deadlock.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mariano Rajoy Re-elected as Spain’s Prime Minister', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Spanish Prime Minister Keeps Job Despite Turmoil', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Popular Party (Spain)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rajoy, Mariano', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sanchez Perez-Castejon, Pedro (1972- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Spain', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-29T18:54:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Raphael Minder', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Raphael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Minder', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a514363e-eb97-5490-856a-be6b6d5d10f0', 'word_count': 808, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a514363e-eb97-5490-856a-be6b6d5d10f0'}, {'abstract': 'It has been, and can again be, “the greatest and most honorable adventure.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/30/opinion/campaign-stops/in-defense-of-politics-now-more-than-ever.html', 'snippet': 'It has been, and can again be, “the greatest and most honorable adventure.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'ONE of John F. Kennedy’s favorite books was John Buchan’s 1940 memoir, “Pilgrim’s Way.” Buchan, who served as a member of Parliament for the combined Scottish universities, wrote, “Public life is regarded as the crown of a career, and to young men it is the worthiest ambition.” Politics, he added, “is still the greatest and most honorable adventure.”', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/30/opinion/sunday/30wehner/30wehner-articleLarge.gif', 'height': 480, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/30/opinion/sunday/30wehner/30wehner-articleLarge.gif', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 480}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/30/opinion/sunday/30wehner/30wehner-jumbo.gif', 'height': 663, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/30/opinion/sunday/30wehner/30wehner-superJumbo.gif', 'height': 663, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/30/opinion/sunday/30wehner/30wehner-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/30/opinion/sunday/30wehner/30wehner-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/30/opinion/sunday/30wehner/30wehner-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Defense of Politics, Now More Than Ever', 'kicker': 'Contributing Op-Ed Writer', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Defense of Politics,  Now More Than Ever', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wehner, Peter', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-29T18:59:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Campaign Stops', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Wehner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wehner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/c230b415-ef34-5815-9fdb-f969fcd7e466', 'word_count': 1255, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c230b415-ef34-5815-9fdb-f969fcd7e466'}, {'abstract': 'If Donald Trump wants to know what a fake democracy is, he should visit his friend Vladimir Putin in Russia.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/10/30/opinion/sunday/america-your-election-is-not-rigged.html', 'snippet': 'If Donald Trump wants to know what a fake democracy is, he should visit his friend Vladimir Putin in Russia.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the last few weeks, the Republican nominee for president, Donald J. Trump, has been talking a lot about how the Nov. 8 election is rigged against him. In fact, he sounds convinced that the entire campaign season is rigged in favor of his Democratic opponent, Hillary Clinton. These are serious charges, or they would be if Mr. Trump had any idea what he was talking about.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/30/opinion/sunday/30kasparov/30kasparov-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/30/opinion/sunday/30kasparov/30kasparov-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/30/opinion/sunday/30kasparov/30kasparov-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/30/opinion/sunday/30kasparov/30kasparov-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 396, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/30/opinion/sunday/30kasparov/30kasparov-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 396}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/30/opinion/sunday/30kasparov/30kasparov-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 676, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/30/opinion/sunday/30kasparov/30kasparov-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1352, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'America, Your Election Is Not Rigged', 'kicker': 'Opinion', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'I Know a Rigged Election. This Isn’t One.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Putin, Vladimir V', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kasparov, Garry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'g