 where a man surrounded by file boxes and paperwork nods off on the sofa, a compact bedroom where two brothers’ very different personalities are on display, an apartment where a father tiptoes from a crib in the single bedroom to a loft bed in the living room.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/31/business/31skymain3/31skymain3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/31/business/31skymain3/31skymain3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/31/business/31skymain3/31skymain3-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/31/business/31skymain3/31skymain3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 325, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/31/business/31skymain3/31skymain3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 325}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/31/business/31skymain3/31skymain3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 554, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/31/business/31skymain3/31skymain3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1108, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Ikea Strategy Ditches the Dream Home for the Daily Grind', 'kicker': 'Advertising', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ditching the Dream Home  for the Daily Grind', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Furniture', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'White, Martha C', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interior Design and Furnishings', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shopping and Retail', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Media', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ikea', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-30T23:43:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Martha C. White', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Martha', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'White', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bbe3001e-d620-548c-bebb-8bcf916da656', 'word_count': 868, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bbe3001e-d620-548c-bebb-8bcf916da656'}, {'abstract': 'John Luther Adams’s hourlong suite, evoking wind, sky and birdsong with human (but wordless) voices, was an ethereally beautiful experience.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/01/arts/music/review-canticles-of-the-holy-wind-summons-the-elements-at-the-met.html', 'snippet': 'John Luther Adams’s hourlong suite, evoking wind, sky and birdsong with human (but wordless) voices, was an ethereally beautiful experience.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s no wonder that birdsong should be central to the work of John Luther Adams, a composer and an environmental activist whose music often draws inspiration from the unspoiled Arctic wilderness that he has fought to preserve. Throughout the ’70s he worked on “songbirdsongs,” a cycle that translates his field observations into crystalline instrumental miniatures for flutes and percussion. Later works sometimes incorporated ornithological quotations, like the different types of thrushes heard in “A Northern Suite.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/31/arts/01CANTICLES/01CANTICLES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/31/arts/01CANTICLES/01CANTICLES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/31/arts/01CANTICLES/01CANTICLES-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/31/arts/01CANTICLES/01CANTICLES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/31/arts/01CANTICLES/01CANTICLES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/31/arts/01CANTICLES/01CANTICLES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/31/arts/01CANTICLES/01CANTICLES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: ‘Canticles of the Holy Wind’ Summons the Elements at the Met', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Summoning