 tournament in Nigeria.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/31/crosswords/1031laughingjpg/1031laughingjpg-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/10/31/crosswords/1031laughingjpg/1031laughingjpg-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/31/crosswords/1031laughingjpg/1031laughingjpg-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/31/crosswords/1031laughingjpg/1031laughingjpg-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/31/crosswords/1031laughingjpg/1031laughingjpg-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/10/31/crosswords/1031laughingjpg/1031laughingjpg-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/10/31/crosswords/1031laughingjpg/1031laughingjpg-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Numberplay Farewell', 'kicker': 'Numberplay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kahneman, Daniel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mathematics', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Puzzles', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Creativity', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Stanford University', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Einstein, Albert', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-31T16:00:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Games', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gary Antonick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Antonick', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4263d8a3-7d9c-5a41-9772-eae15f7cb00e', 'word_count': 557, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4263d8a3-7d9c-5a41-9772-eae15f7cb00e'}, {'abstract': 'The television personality Padma Lakshmi and the spice purveyor Lior Lev Sercarz have published books on seasonings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/02/dining/padma-lakshmi-lior-lev-sercarz-spice-guides.html', 'snippet': 'The television personality Padma Lakshmi and the spice purveyor Lior Lev Sercarz have published books on seasonings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two of the city’s best spice purveyors now have reference guides. Padma Lakshmi, the television personality and cookbook author, has collaborated with Kalustyan’s, a magic carpet of ingredients on Lexington Avenue and 29th Street, on an A-to-Z guide to spices and herbs. Color photos illustrate many of the entries and typical uses, but no recipes are given. Lior Lev Sercarz, who owns La Boîte, a spice shop on 11th Avenue and 51st Street, and who custom-blends spices for chefs, has also done a guide. The handsome book comes in a box, is lavishly photographed and is organized alphabetically to cover spices and herbs. There are no recipes, but suggested uses are given for each product. Mr. Sercarz explains how to best buy, blend, roast and store seasonings, and how spices are sanitized to be sold: “The Encyclopedia of Spices & Herbs: An Essential Guide to the Flavors of the World,” by Padma Lakshmi with Judith Sutton and Kalustyan’s (Harper Collins, $25); “The Spice Companion: A Guide to the World of Spices,” by Lior Lev Sercarz (Clarkson Potter, $40, $50 with slipcase).', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/02/dining/02burnerbooks/02burnerbooks-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/02/dining/02burnerbooks/02burnerbooks-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/02/dining/02burnerbooks/02burnerbooks-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/02/dining/02burnerbooks/02burnerbooks-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 432, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/02/dining/02burnerbooks/02burnerbooks-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 432}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/02/dining/02burnerbooks/02burnerbooks-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 737, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/02/dining/02burnerbooks/02burnerbooks-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1473, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Two Books Unlock the Secrets of Spice', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'cont