ith the United States.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/01/world/asia/malaysia-china.html', 'snippet': 'The Malaysian prime minister arrived in Beijing on Monday ready to buy Chinese military hardware, an arrangement that will rattle his relationship with the United States.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIJING — Malaysia’s prime minister, miffed by a Justice Department investigation into his nation’s sovereign wealth fund, arrived in Beijing on Monday ready to buy Chinese military hardware, a deal that will rattle his relationship with the United States.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/01/world/01CHina-Malaysia-web/01CHina-Malaysia-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/01/world/01CHina-Malaysia-web/01CHina-Malaysia-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/01/world/01CHina-Malaysia-web/01CHina-Malaysia-web-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/01/world/01CHina-Malaysia-web/01CHina-Malaysia-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/01/world/01CHina-Malaysia-web/01CHina-Malaysia-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/01/world/01CHina-Malaysia-web/01CHina-Malaysia-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/01/world/01CHina-Malaysia-web/01CHina-Malaysia-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Leader of Malaysia, Miffed at U.S., Visits China With a Deal in Mind', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Malaysia Leader in China Seeking Military Hardware', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Perlez, Jane', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Malaysia', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Najib Razak', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': '1Malaysia Development Berhad (1MDB)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Arms Trade', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2016-10-31T16:24:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jane Perlez', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jane', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Perlez', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ad78ab63-4eb4-569d-97e9-8e3cd6b41a67', 'word_count': 915, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ad78ab63-4eb4-569d-97e9-8e3cd6b41a67'}, {'abstract': 'The Cheese Grotto promises a better storage solution for your cheeses.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2016/11/02/dining/cheese-grotto-refrigerator-storage.html', 'snippet': 'The Cheese Grotto promises a better storage solution for your cheeses.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Storing fine cheeses properly at home has long been a challenge. You can invest in special double-ply wrapping paper, but the temperature and humidity of a refrigerator do not flatter them. Working with an engineer and an industrial designer, Jessica Sennett, who has been behind the counters at Cowgirl Creamery and Bedford Cheese Shop, has developed a solution. Her Cheese Grotto is a sturdy box with removable wooden shelves, a clay slab in the bottom and ventilation ducts in the back. Moisture is maintained by periodically soaking the clay. Cheeses are stored unwrapped. The box’s footprint is around the size of a standard sheet of copy paper, and at 8½ inches high, it can fit in a refrigerator or sit comfortably on a kitchen counter. It can be ordered for $350 and will ship four weeks after the order date: cheesegrotto.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/02/dining/02burnerbox/02burnerbox-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2016/11/02/dining/02burnerbox/02burnerbox-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/02/dining/02burnerbox/02burnerbox-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/11/02/dining/02burnerbox/02burnerbox-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 458, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/11/02/dining/02burnerbox/02burnerbox-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 458}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, '